\"Reviewer\": \"Devendra Yadav\"}, {\"$id\": \"27\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-22T07:28:13.3138642Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">\\\"Chronicle IAS is unparalleled when it comes to Current Affairs. Their monthly magazines and classroom discussions cover everything from a 360-degree perspective. It makes reading newspapers and linking them to the static syllabus so much easier. Perfect for both Prelims and Mains!\\\"</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSb2NXSkpTazkwTWxaYWEzZDNhMWN3YkdOU01rRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Laxmi Verma\"}, {\"$id\": \"28\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-22T07:28:13.3953743Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">\\\"What sets them apart is the \'Personal Mentorship\' program. You aren\'t just a roll number here. The mentors take the time to sit with you, discuss your mock test scores, and help you overcome your personal hurdles in preparation. Highly grateful to the team.\\\"</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGRGMzUlpVRW8yWWpOek1IRllOVTlIUm01ZmRFRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Nikhil ChronicleIAS\"}, {\"$id\": \"29\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-22T07:28:13.5212474Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">One of the best institute for ias and pcs . Great infrastructure, supportive staff and very structured teaching methodology. A must visit if you are planning to start your civil services journey.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wcU5sSm5iblJDU1cxVVYwWjRkbVZOTFZsVk5VRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Bhavna sharma\"}, {\"$id\": \"30\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-22T07:28:13.6064753Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Knowledgeable and supportive faculty.Good comprehensive study materials &amp; curriculum.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGdGNYcFJiVEI0YjJwdFlYcFpOSGh3TWxoZlMwRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Komal Singh\"}, {\"$id\": \"31\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-22T07:28:13.6919042Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Best Ias ACADEMY in india and top current affairs book provider</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKYWVuTkdkR3h5TlVGbFJXNTNkMGM1T0c1TVdFRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"NIKHIL RATHORE\"}, {\"$id\": \"32\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-22T07:28:13.7798917Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Excellent Coaching institute for ias and uppcs..</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCS1RFUTNhRVZsYVdaS1dUQmhVRUZpZFRKR2VHYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sonam Singh\"}, {\"$id\": \"33\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-22T07:28:13.9046753Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The Best coaching centre. The experience was good ? …</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pSTVZqaGpPVlo1UjFSRlQwbDZUbGhETFhoWlVVRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pranav Rajput\"}, {\"$id\": \"34\", \"Date\": \"2019-05-22T07:28:16.0640665Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Extremely unprofessional and poor service. They\'re providing extremely cheap materials full of wrong information at an exorbitant rate. The employees are extremely rude and hound candidates to buy materials from them. I request every UPSC …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-131\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURZdUplY2pBRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1406.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXY5T3pCcjh5VUF4VS11cXdDSGZtMkJWVVEwcE1GQ0Jvb0NBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURZdUplY2pBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Xyz Xtz\"}, {\"$id\": \"35\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-22T07:28:18.1868507Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">No don\'t need material by the way thanks  for contacting me</span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21ac1NtOTJkbXBDYXpoMlpVczNla3R2TkdsTWNYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"