ime\": \"10 am–7:30 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Sunday\", \"Time\": \"10 am–7:30 pm\"}], \"Category\": \"More\"}]','{\"Reviews\": [{\"Date\": \"2026-05-22T07:48:09.9855158Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I wanted to take a moment to express my heartfelt gratitude for all your dedication and hard work. Your passion for teaching and patience in guiding us through challenges have made a significant impact on my learning. You always go the …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-14\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURIdnM2cE1BEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle184.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aW5oT0w4czh5VUF4VVVzcXdDSGJhQURBd1EwcE1GQ0FJb0FBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURIdnM2cE1BEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Vasudev jat\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-22T07:48:10.0868337Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">This coaching is very good and it provides a nice and educational environment.\\nIt enhances the skills of a student by taking regular tests and develops a competion stamina in a child , which provides a wings to child to fly  towards their dream .</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURId2MycG1BRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"SHRADDHA OJHA\"}, {\"Date\": \"2023-05-22T07:48:10.2046313Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It\'s one of the best institute for jee preparation in NCR. Faculties are helpful and qualified from the Indian Institute Of Technology themselves. Their explanations are clear and students get counseling and guidance if they are facing any issue in their studies. Highly recommended!!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQtX19ETjhnRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"HIMANSHU SINHA\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-05-22T07:48:12.2951224Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Terrible experience...don\'t waste your hard earned money in this coaching centre. They started last year in gaur city and half of their students left with in 5-6 months as they were struggling to get the passing marks in 11th and 12th grade itself.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNadGRYRmV3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Deepak Sharma\"}, {\"Date\": \"2023-05-22T07:48:12.3937375Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Their warm learning environment is their biggest strength, the teachers are highly skilled as well as experienced, and overall it\'s an excellent institution for students!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQtei1mMmh3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Neha Deol\"}, {\"Date\": \"2023-05-22T07:48:12.4721242Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Phenomenal institute and superb faculty.\\nTeachers are doing an excellent job. Doubt solving facilities is good.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQtejRUcDNRRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Yash Yadav\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-22T07:48:12.5895901Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">great teachers and help students cope up. tbh the best till now</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURvdTlHekZREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Abhishekk Attree\"}, {\"Date\": \"2023-05-22T07:48:12.683847Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Experienced IIT faculty with experiential learning based teaching methods. Highly recommended.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQtajhmSXpnRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Vidyanshu Mishra\"}, {\"Date\": \"2023-05-22T07:48:12.7941036Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I have also prepared from here for jee and from my experience I can say that this is one of the best institute.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURHMTZXY3Z3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Saurabh Kumar Shah\"}, {\"Date\": \"2023-05-22T07:48:12.8783368Z