.4969064Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Best coaching centre in crossing republic. I highly recommend you to join. 5/5 stars</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xTVpFTk5UMDFwUjNsYU4yWnNjbEZUYlZkc2RGRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Manish singh\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-02-22T08:11:13.5973515Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Recommended for parents who want personal attention for their child\'s studies. GREAT ? …</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21OSVpqZExWbFZhVkRSMWVFNXNkRk5VTkVGaWExRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Digital Digix\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-16T08:11:13.6719018Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Very strong foundation for Physics. Derivations made simple.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20wemEwRkdjWFJMWlZKdVptc3llVTVHYld4RGJuYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Avanish Srivastava\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-16T08:11:13.7732407Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Best teaching, fun and interactive learning</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ReVoxOUxlbVZqYVRSQlNGZ3hlSHB5WkhaVGExRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Manisha Shah\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-16T08:11:13.8728404Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Comfortable and friendly atmosphere, appreciate the guidance and teaching with understanding</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOR1dGVm9aa2xVTVhCSFZqQkRTV0ZRUzFCWGVWRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"anuja mehta\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-16T08:11:13.9635562Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">An excellent and dedicated teacher who explains concepts clearly and effectively across Physics, Mathematics and Chemistry. Creates an engaging learning environment, encourages critical thinking, and consistently supports students to …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-20\\\" aria-label=\\\"See