": \"Monday\", \"Time\": \"9:30 am–8 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Thursday\", \"Time\": \"9:30 am–8 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Friday\", \"Time\": \"9:30 am–8 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Saturday\", \"Time\": \"9:30 am–8 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Sunday\", \"Time\": \"9:30 am–8 pm\"}], \"Category\": \"More\"}]','{\"Reviews\": [{\"Date\": \"2026-02-22T09:30:37.466453Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Love this shop. I m regular customer since last 5 year . Ultimate tyres suggest given by team. Showroom is very neet and clean. They have good tyres options. Loan facility also available here. Highly recommended this shop for new tyres</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25FMFR6UjVjbTh5TUVGSGJrcGxjVzgxVlhaNVprRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sherpal Singh\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-02-22T09:30:37.5770559Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Best tyres shop in noida. Good inventory available ready stock and latest material. They register online warranty no need at the time of warranty claim. Price are also responsible compared to other tyres shop.\\nPerfect service. Highly recommend</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25NMVZsVnRkMjVUYjA1WVNqTkZWbUZpYzFGbFdFRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Deepu Rathour\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-22T09:30:37.7215324Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Best place for alignment &amp;balacing..,\\nAnd i admire the way they treat &amp; suggest customers for maintaining the vehicle.And also the quality of service they provide is undoubtedly the best in nearby …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-64\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsSmFDMDRSMUp4TUc0d1ZrbGhhMDlCZGxGMGMwRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle710.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUN3dnp2eXN5VUF4WEh5QnNBSFdoSkJTQVEwcE1GQ0JJb0FnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\":