 be done from your shop.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21rMU0yc3pjblJaWW1NdE5VSTFkMHBzV1ZSS1dtYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Abhishek Singh\"}, {\"$id\": \"40\", \"Date\": \"2024-05-22T09:31:57.5757601Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Tyre service for all type of cars.\\nGood facility but attitude of worker need to be improve.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUREb3VHZUpREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shyam\"}, {\"$id\": \"41\", \"Date\": \"2022-05-22T09:31:57.6603793Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Got Wheel Alignment done at 200 ₹ . Wheel Balancing as per Weight installed . They have also kept some useful accessories like Portable Tyre Inflators and TPMS system to monitor Air Pressure in your tyres on your phone .\\nGood to have this in Noida .</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNXeDhfMFBREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Kama & Co\"}, {\"$id\": \"42\", \"Date\": \"2025-10-22T09:31:59.8150585Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">They tried to mislead and cheat me, I left the place soon I felt I was being deceived. Owner and staff both are equally indulged in this.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkeWRGOXZVVE5tTWxWbFkwTjVSVWxEU1c5UkxVRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sudhanshu Singh\"}, {\"$id\": \"43\", \"Date\": \"2025-10-22T09:31:59.9838922Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Very good staff behaviour and quick response. Must visit to every needy person.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSdlIyZHJURTlMVW5CT1FqVXhXVGRTT0VacmIyYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Piyush Soni\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"Shop No 1, Rishal Plaza, Bisrakh Rd, opposite Ace City, Sector 3, Patwari, Noida, Bisrakh Jalalpur, Uttar Pradesh 201318\", \"Website\": \"brandshops.jktyre\", \"Latitude\": 28.5612874