}, {\"Day\": \"Sunday\", \"Time\": \"9 am–8 pm\"}], \"Category\": \"More\"}]','{\"Reviews\": [{\"Date\": \"2026-02-22T10:04:10.2253868Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Transition classes is really good overall. Classes are regular, teachers are helpful, and doubts are cleared properly. Especially Arun sir helped a lot with the physics, concepts are crystal clear. Helped a lot with my NEET and CBSE preparation.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WeGMzZzVUVmxQWjFoUk5VSXhOMkpvYzBobVVrRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shreya\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-02-22T10:04:10.2941276Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I would like to thank you for the coaching you have given me. Your style and method is very effective, helping me to refocus my energies and complete some major goals in my busy life.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ScGNVMTRRa2xmVmtSbVIwaFpPRkZvTURkbllYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Aradia Sharma\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-22T10:04:10.3586574Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Transition classes is one of the best coaching center. Our child goes for maths tuition and tutor is very sound in his subject. He likes the way of teaching. I would recommend to all to choose Transition Classes without any second thought.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURvNF9TQlhBEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sita Bisht\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-22T10:04:10.4474688Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Transition classes is one of the best coaching centre. Staff in this coaching centre is highly knowledgeable especially the physics teacher. His teaching style is very engaging and interactive. Best thing is he teaches each concept with real life examples which helps to learn and understand more easily.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRbnEtaF9BRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shubham Bhatia\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-22T10:04:10.5132824Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">My daughter goes to Transition Classes for studying Maths and Science. Both the teachers there are having sound knowledge of their subjects. And, do a lot of hard work with kids to teach them, enhance their knowledge and take enough tests …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-86\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRcnByTG9BRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle862.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXdfTnl2MHN5VUF4WEV0NndDSGRtcENnc1EwcE1GQ0E0b0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRcnByTG9BRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Puneet Prakash\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-22T10:04:10.5978813Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">An excellent place for learning physics! The concepts are explained in a clear and engaging way, making even complex topics easy to understand. The teaching approach is interactive, and there’s a strong focus on problem-solving, which really helps in exams. Highly recommend for anyone looking to strengthen their physics foundation!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRcnRxQy1nRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Navendu sharma\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-22T10:04:10.6478449Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Transition Classes is a very good centre for the preparation of competitive exams. The centre has quality teachers with good experience. Specially Physics, rather a tough subject, is taught well by Physics sir. Sir also takes doubts of students and regularly schedule for numericals.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNBaEp1cFFnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Manoranjan Bhuyan\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-22T10:04:10.6968704Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Best coaching centre in Noida extension... My son is studying there last 2 mnth. Sir &amp; ma\'am are very cooperative &amp; teaching style is  very friendly.\\nMust join that institution</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURvMmJuSE53EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Jyoti Arora\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-22T10:04:10.7716399Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Transition classes is best coaching in Noida extension. Specially chemistry ma\'am, the way she teach is very effective to understand the subject.....</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURRdTczaXFnRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Rc pal si\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-22T10:04:10.8306387Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Arun Sir teaches Physics with enthusiasm and clears all the doubts by giving simple examples through which the concepts get clear. When he teaches physics I am very easily able to imagine the world of physics in my mind. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-91\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURfdjhYTnd3RRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle867.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXdfTnl2MHN5VUF4WEV0NndDSGRtcENnc1EwcE1GQ0Iwb0NRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURfdjhYTnd3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Naman Singh\"}], \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}','[{\"LargeUrl\": \"https://streetviewpixels-pa.googleapis.com/v1/thumbnail?output=thumbnail&cb_client=maps_sv.tactile.gps&panoid=Z-PSDePH6ZmRGIcrrCQv-g&w=588&h=290&thumb=2&yaw=107.004074&pitch=0\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://streetviewpixels-pa.googleapis.com/v1/thumbnail?panoid=Z-PSDePH6ZmRGIcrrCQv-g&cb_client=maps_sv.tactile.gps&w=203&h=100&yaw=107.004074&pitch=0&thumbfov=100\"}, {\"LargeUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/p/AF1QipP7tV1GERzaXjFpkf2qwspfHG124mw4wDBWNILF=s406-k-no\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/p/AF1QipP7tV1GERzaXjFpkf2qwspfHG124mw4wD