 all doubts are cleared n as a student i recommend that more students should participate</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURWcTZpcUN3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pinky Vishwakarma\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-05-22T10:09:55.9237991Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Excellent home tuition service as a teacher I must say that is good for all like teachers, students and employees one of the best educational service</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURWcTlUSzh3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pramod Kumar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-05-22T10:09:56.0170015Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The consistently high academic performance among the students in our class and demonstrate the positive impact of our teaching on ours learning outcomes.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMxOHREZlRREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Gulapsha Khan\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-05-22T10:09:56.1427827Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Best home tuition service with affordable budget</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURWcTVDbkdREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Adriti Jain\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-05-22T10:09:56.230178Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Best faculty in the best prices and teachers are also very helpful.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNUM29fdGVnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Gulapsha Khan\"}], \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}','[{\"LargeUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/p/AF1QipMFvYvnzVLTPBz-xpm0Mgd4UHkRp_jKN_dBL7UW=s451-k-no\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/p/AF1QipMFvYvnzVLTPBz-xpm0Mgd4UHkRp_jKN_dBL7UW=w203-h152-k-no\"}, {\"LargeUrl\": \"\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/p/AF1QipPEQXDm5Mul9Xjms_U-fduRnRCw8dRewgGUm6js=w203-h114-k-no\"}, {\"LargeUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/p/AF1QipMx29JtEZQBsn5O_GVPN_gqO_Gu84Uex79YsjDq=s386-k-no\", \"ThumbUrl\