(1062,'google-cid:0x390cef8442b86307:0xb4d7d6322b50c661',29113,'Rita Thanai Coaching Centre','रीता थाने कोचिंग सेंटर','B-211, Techzone 4, Amrapali Leisure Valley, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201318','099714 38761','','','',5.00,45,'','https://www.google.com/maps/place/Rita+Thanai+Coaching+Centre/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390cef8442b86307:0xb4d7d6322b50c661!8m2!3d28.5863974!4d77.4361641!16s%2Fg%2F11g0hn221n!19sChIJB2O4QoTvDDkRYcZQKzLW17Q?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1','[]','[{\"Key\": \"address\", \"Value\": [\"Address: B-211, Techzone 4, Amrapali Leisure Valley, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201318\"]}, {\"Key\": \"phone:tel:09971438761\", \"Value\": [\"Phone: 099714 38761\"]}, {\"Key\": \"oloc\", \"Value\": [\"Plus code: HCPP+HF Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh\"]}, {\"Key\": \"Service options\", \"Value\": [\"Offers online classes\", \"On-site services available\"]}]','[{\"Hours\": [{\"Day\": \"Tuesday\\n(Eid al-Adha)\", \"Time\": \"11 am–8 pm\\nHours might differ\"}, {\"Day\": \"Wednesday\\n(Eid al-Adha)\", \"Time\": \"11 am–8 pm\\nHours might differ\"}, {\"Day\": \"Monday\", \"Time\": \"11 am–8 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Thursday\", \"Time\": \"11 am–8 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Friday\", \"Time\": \"11 am–8 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Saturday\", \"Time\": \"11 am–8 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Sunday\", \"Time\": \"11 am–8 pm\"}], \"Category\": \"More\"}]','{\"Reviews\": [{\"Date\": \"2026-05-22T10:11:07.0456171Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Rita ma\'am is a brilliant teacher.\\nShe does a lot of hard work for her students and her efforts pay off.\\nThe material she provides -worksheets assignments notes,etc showcases her experience. I really appreciate her efforts and teaching.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURRbmRqYV9BRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Aryan\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-22T10:11:07.3494811Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Rita ma\'am\'s dedication and guidance were invaluable; thanks to her, I transformed from fearing science and maths to excelling in them, scoring 99 and 96 in my 10th boards. With her mentorship, I achieved an overall percentage of 98%, a testament to her exceptional teaching and support.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUbDdXejJBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Tabassum Ali\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-22T10:11:07.4910722Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">One of the best teacher for Maths and science for classes upto 10. She is a result oriented teacher who strives to get best from her students.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURRMVp6YUl3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"ankita chaudhary\"}, {\"Date\": \"2021-05-22T10:11:07.6765327Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The best place where you can get quality education with a happy environment. Rita Ma\'am\'s teaching method is very different from other teachers and is very effective. She is one of the best teachers you can have guidance from in your lifetime. Never miss out this chance !!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR5OWIzeW1RRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Ritul\"}, {\"Date\": \"2022-05-22T10:11:07.7728562Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">This year I had my class 10th board examination but it wasn\'t held due to the COVID 19 pandemic, even before we knew this Rita Ma\'am constantly prepared us with innocent and true efforts thought out the year. Wether it was internal …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-206\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNhbWN6RU13EAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2432.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3akowcmoyMDh5VUF4VXBzS3dDSFR2bENxc1EwcE1GQ0E0b0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNhbWN6RU13EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Ritul\"}, {\"Date\": \"2019-05-22T10:11:07.9841777Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Rita thanai coaching classes has been the pillar of my good grades throughout my school. The teaching process is excellent and thereafter revision of the course keeps you updated. Rita aunty has not only been my tutor in school time but …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-207\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURJLWJUVUN3EAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2433.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3akowcmoyMDh5VUF4VXBzS3dDSFR2bENxc1EwcE1GQ0JFb0JRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURJLWJUVUN3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Mohini Gupta\"}, {\"Date\": \"2020-05-22T10:11:08.1344693Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I\'ve had the honour of studying from Rita ma\'am. She is a very hardworking teacher and a gem of a person whose only aim has always been to make sure that all her students pass with flying colours. It doesn\'t come as a surprise to me that this year\'s India\'s Joint Topper of CBSE 10th std. was one of her students. Many Congratulations!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURrNFluVnhBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"S D\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-22T10:11:08.2237845Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Great environment. Has provided me with exceptional education. She is supportive and has great experience. Highly recommend her.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURRbThDT1JnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"bhumika rungta\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-05-22T10:11:08.314999Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">She is a very well qualified math teacher. She pays full attention to every child and no child can remain weak in maths after taking her tuition.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM5ejhTQ2RREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"ANSHU RANA\"}, {\"Date\": \"2019-05-22T10: