(1063,'google-cid:0x390ce97f70c8a283:0x889ed5e25be0de3a',29114,'ATS COACHING CENTRE','एटीएस कोचिंग सेंटर','Pusta road, Dadri Main Rd, near D.V.M public school, Kulesara, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201306','085100 03737','sciencearena.com','http://www.sciencearena.com/','',4.80,213,'','https://www.google.com/maps/place/ATS+COACHING+CENTRE/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390ce97f70c8a283:0x889ed5e25be0de3a!8m2!3d28.5278155!4d77.4371745!16s%2Fg%2F11rsbbvjmm!19sChIJg6LIcH_pDDkROt7gW-LVnog?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1','[]','[{\"Key\": \"address\", \"Value\": [\"Address: Pusta road, Dadri Main Rd, near D.V.M public school, Kulesara, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201306\"]}, {\"Key\": \"authority\", \"Value\": [\"Website: sciencearena.com\"]}, {\"Key\": \"phone:tel:08510003737\", \"Value\": [\"Phone: 085100 03737\"]}, {\"Key\": \"oloc\", \"Value\": [\"Plus code: GCHP+4V Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh\"]}, {\"Key\": \"Accessibility\", \"Value\": [\"Has wheelchair-accessible car park\", \"Has wheelchair-accessible entrance\", \"Has wheelchair-accessible seating\", \"Has wheelchair-accessible toilet\"]}, {\"Key\": \"Service options\", \"Value\": [\"On-site services available\", \"No online classes\"]}, {\"Key\": \"Amenities\", \"Value\": [\"Has gender-neutral toilets\"]}, {\"Key\": \"Exams\", \"Value\": [\"CBSE board exam coaching\", \"JEE exam coaching\", \"NEET exam coaching\"]}, {\"Key\": \"Parking\", \"Value\": [\"Free parking garage\", \"Free parking lot\", \"Free street parking\"]}]','[{\"Hours\": [{\"Day\": \"Tuesday\\n(Eid al-Adha)\", \"Time\": \"3–8 pm\\nHours might differ\"}, {\"Day\": \"Wednesday\\n(Eid al-Adha)\", \"Time\": \"3–8 pm\\nHours might differ\"}, {\"Day\": \"Monday\", \"Time\": \"3–8 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Thursday\", \"Time\": \"3–8 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Friday\", \"Time\": \"Open 24 hours\"}, {\"Day\": \"Saturday\", \"Time\": \"3–8 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Sunday\", \"Time\": \"Closed\"}], \"Category\": \"More\"}]','{\"Reviews\": [{\"Date\": \"2025-08-22T10:13:58.1574715Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">ATS coaching is an excellent institute that has helped many students achieve their goals. The faculty here provides personal guidance to aspiring students. I highly recommend this to anyone looking to achieve success in life.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xselIwUmFObTltZG5GT1RrOUlNSEZ3VGpKQ05GRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Preeti Chauhan\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-08-22T10:13:58.2399188Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Since I have started studying in ATS my all concepts are cleared and my all doubts are also got vanished. The teachers are very good and their way of teaching is great of all other teachers. Thank you respected teacher of ATS toh make my future bright ✨</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aeGEwdDZjbFozT1VjdFkzaHRhMlZETURCRWJtYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Suryansh Rai\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-08-22T10:13:58.328873Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">ATS Coaching Classes has been truly enriching. The way the teachers break down complex topics in Biology, Physics, and Chemistry makes learning enjoyable and effective. Supportive learning environment with focus on concepts as well as application</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCdGRVUllVbWxJY2xKdWRWZFJOVGhyWjJ0WlJYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Kanchan Upadhyay\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-02-22T10:13:58.4235169Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The environment here is very good and the teachers here are very friendly due to which no student feels any fear in asking any question and now the coaching shift that has happened is also very good</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxSWJuWTFVVFZEUVdsa2VIWnpjMVZpUkhWc1VYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Manav Awasthi\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-09-22T10:13:58.5570947Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I am newly joined to the ats coaching center and  I experience that