 center with experienced teachers and a supportive environment. Their teaching style is clear, and study material is well-structured. Regular tests and doubt sessions really help in improving performance. Overall, AIM Classes is the best place for focused learning and great results.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21ocmQySkJhV05ZYTNaRlJrRXlYMWh1ZWtSUldVRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Piyush Jha\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-22T10:19:19.1177274Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Best coaching in bhangel, Avinash sir\'s study method is very good and sir also gives the assessment and worksheets periodically which are very helpful in scoring. My son scores very good. I think it\'s the best coaching in bhangel for our childrens.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxaFRFdHpXSE0wYUhwM01uVmtSV2Q0VmxWNVJHYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"TARUN SHARMA\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-22T10:19:19.1961334Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I love the way of teaching by avinash mishra sir , he is the great teacher and also inspiring\\nBest to choose for studying in bhangel. Get no regret , but lot\'s of knowledge from AIMS classes ✅</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5Vldsb3RSVGx0VW5aSWJFRTBOVGR2YURWa1JXYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Nitya Singh\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-22T10:19:19.2790744Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Best coaching classes in bhangel for physics and maths.Classes have smart board with good ambience and next level features.Teachers are very possessive and understand students problem.It has an AC overall coaching is good.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psQ1VFTlJSbU5oV0ZkRU1XbHBWR3BqT0RSMmJtYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Nitish XI-A\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-22T10:19:19.3637757Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">A focus on practical knowledge and personalized attention, which helps students better understand and provide\\nHigh-quality materials, such as study guides and test series, which are very useful for students.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4UVpHSmxWV3h3V1ZKRWJFOVlTbnBXV1cxWVprRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"PRACHI YADAV\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-22T10:19:19.4531389Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">\\\"Sir\'s teaching methods are superb. Concepts are explained so clearly that even the toughest topics become easy to understand. Highly recommended!\\\"</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5MmRXcGlSWEZMTkZCSVNYbzJkazUyUnpreGEzYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sanjeev rai\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-22T10:19:19.5286807Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">One of the best coaching in noida if you want doubt clearnce, concept clarity,tests and best results you can go to this coaching</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twRmJqVlJZelZ5YkZoemQzRTRMV2RSU1VWQ2NsRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Arpit Thakur\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-22T10:19:19.6218301Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Teachers are well educated and friendly, provide a good study environment to all students.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aS2FVRjFhVGw1YzBOa1QxUnFiQzFFVGkxRmRGRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Divya Kaushik\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-22T10:19:19.700227Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Very nice coching and All results successfully result ......?❣️ Thankyou so much Aim classes …</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wWFJtdGZaVnBRUzNWd1ZteERUMlJpZEc5bk9GRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Gaurav Sharma\"}], \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}','[{\"LargeUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/p/AF1QipOJxnzAznI2YRCwadZ5egAwdBdbDIXuIEdfrvbz=s451-k-no\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/p/AF1QipOJxnzAznI2YRCwadZ5egAwdBdbDIXuIEdfrvbz=w203-h152-k-no\"}, {\"LargeUrl\": \