am–7 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Sunday\", \"Time\": \"10 am–7 pm\"}], \"Category\": \"More\"}]','{\"Reviews\": [{\"Date\": \"2025-12-22T10:54:42.3332039Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I had installed Vredestein tyres from Golden Tyre,Panchvati colony GT Road. After running nearly 15,000 km, one of the tyres burst. I came here today, and they charged only the minimum amount and replaced the tyre within just 15 minutes. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-82\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xZd1JXTjBhR1poTnpobWQxbGpORzh3YVdreFFWRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle716.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3akM2YzdWM2N5VUF4VTh1YXdDSFFNckpBSVEwcE1GQ0FJb0FBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xZd1JXTjBhR1poTnpobWQxbGpORzh3YVdreFFWRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Mukhiya Mohit Gurjar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-12-22T10:54:42.4130497Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">This place is one of the best spots to get your car tires taken care of—whether it’s alignment, balancing, or getting a new tire. The owners and all the workers treat you with respect, speak politely, and they finish the job as quickly as possible. Highly recommended for fast, courteous, and reliable service.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210RGNYZzBWMFpGYjFST1dGOTRZa2QwV2sxM09FRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"ankit garg\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-22T10:54:42.4890571Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Authorised Dealer. Genuine Product. Best Rates. Fair Dealing. All you need for a trusted purchase.\\nThe owner was generous enough to carry the tyre set to his home for timely porter delivery. Highly recommended.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205elRuTkVSMTloWDJWRFNVWkNkV051ZVZkQ1dIYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Deepak Bhagtani\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-12-22T10:54:42.5791272Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Must visit for excellent WHEEL care services. The attention to detail in servicing is just marvellous. Parking the car on the lift, taking good care of the alloy wheels, a thorough inspection of Wheels, for any sort of leakages/defects and …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-85\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkSFNrWjFSVGhPVjE5TlgxWXlTMHhUY2pKRVpYYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle719.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3akM2YzdWM2N5VUF4VTh1YXdDSFFNckpBSVEwcE1GQ0JVb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkSFNrWjFSVGhPVjE5TlgxWXlTMHhUY2pKRVpYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Tejender Singh\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-01-22T10:54:42.6396103Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I have been a regular customer of Golden Tyres for the last 7 years, and my experience has always been excellent. I get my wheel balancing and alignment done after every 5,000 km, and they always do the job perfectly. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-86\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwVGIwZHNNMlZHU21kTU5USmFSbFEwVERCRExXYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle720.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3akM2YzdWM2N5VUF4VTh1YXdDSFFNckpBSVEwcE1GQ0Jvb0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwVGIwZHNNMlZHU21kTU5USmFSbFEwVERCRExXYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Arjun G Ahuja\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-06-22T10:54:42.7020706Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Best place to get your car for alignment &amp; Road force balancing &amp; A New Headlight Alignment is a new service which is added to there service, kindly get your cars headlight aligned, because I got mine &amp; 100% satisfied. They Provide the Best …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-87\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VNMkxrWnl4djVydFpBEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle721.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3akM2YzdWM2N5VUF4VTh1YXdDSFFNckpBSVEwcE1GQ0Iwb0JRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VNMkxrWnl4djVydFpBEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pranav Dua\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-01-22T10:54:42.7987812Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Had a very good experience at Golden Tyre. I had an issue with my tyre and honestly I was quite confused about what exactly needed to be done. The team patiently checked everything and advised a prompt and practical solution without trying …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-88\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21seGFUVnVVVk01WlVodE1IVnFlVU0zVkhnd1JIYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle722.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3akM2YzdWM2N5VUF4VTh1YXdDSFFNckpBSVEwcE1GQ0NZb0JnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21seGFUVnVVVk01WlVodE1IVnFlVU0zVkhnd1JIYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"nitin morale\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-02-22T10:54:42.8608467Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Very good service. The owners and the staff is very polite and professional. The owners provided proper guidance on which tyres fits best as per my usage. The staff is very skilled and professional. Overall management is also very good. Highly recommended.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21SWGVFUlBTbk5VWVhsUVdIRldYMTlGYlZsU2FrRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Kanishk Raj Vaish\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-10-22T10:54:42.9170988Z\", \"Te