e best spots to get your car tires taken care of—whether it’s alignment, balancing, or getting a new tire. The owners and all the workers treat you with respect, speak politely, and they finish the job as quickly as possible. Highly recommended for fast, courteous, and reliable service.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210RGNYZzBWMFpGYjFST1dGOTRZa2QwV2sxM09FRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"ankit garg\"}, {\"$id\": \"36\", \"Date\": \"2025-11-22T10:54:42.4890571Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Authorised Dealer. Genuine Product. Best Rates. Fair Dealing. All you need for a trusted purchase.\\nThe owner was generous enough to carry the tyre set to his home for timely porter delivery. Highly recommended.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205elRuTkVSMTloWDJWRFNVWkNkV051ZVZkQ1dIYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Deepak Bhagtani\"}, {\"$id\": \"37\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-22T10:54:42.5791272Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Must visit for excellent WHEEL care services. The attention to detail in servicing is just marvellous. Parking the car on the lift, taking good care of the alloy wheels, a thorough inspection of Wheels, for any sort of leakages/defects and …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-85\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkSFNrWjFSVGhPVjE5TlgxWXlTMHhUY2pKRVpYYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle719.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3akM2YzdWM2N5VUF4VTh1YXdDSFFNckpBSVEwcE1GQ0JVb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkSFNrWjFSVGhPVjE5TlgxWXlTMHhUY2pKRVpYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Tejender Singh\"}, {\"$id\": \"38\", \"Date\": \"2026-01-22T10:54:42.6396103Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I have been a regular customer of Golden Tyres for the last 7 years, and my experi