-91\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoWWRIVXdVMFZ6VFdSdldrTnZaV1JEWkVodExXYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle910.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3amppS3VqbTl1VUF4VVVzcXdDSFk4R0hzTVEwcE1GQ0RVb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoWWRIVXdVMFZ6VFdSdldrTnZaV1JEWkVodExXYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Praveen Saxena\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-02-28T05:07:36.444382Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The working environment is not satisfactory. We are experiencing difficulties during the winter season due to the lack of blowers. Moreover, elevator wait times are often excessive, sometimes extending to 10–15 minutes.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 2, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wYWNYWXhZalJ2VGxSd05HOU5kMVY2VDNoM2QyYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Kriti Raj\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-09-28T05:07:36.4898136Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">ETHEREA is a very nice co-working space. The place is clean and well-organized, with comfortable seating and fast Wi-Fi. It is quiet and good for focusing on work. The staff is friendly and helpful. Meeting rooms are easy to use, and the …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-93\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSNVIxcDVWMGhKUzJrMFVWRmxaRTExV0RoYVNWRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle912.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3amppS3VqbTl1VUF4VVVzcXdDSFk4R0hzTVEwcE1GQ0Rzb0JRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSNVIxcDVWMGhKUzJrMFVWRmxaRTExV0RoYVNWRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Tejasvi Raj\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-09-28T05:07:36.5395726Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Etherea Co-working Space is excellent! The office, washrooms, and cafeteria are always very clean. My cabin is neat every day when I arrive. Professional staff and great service make it a wonderful place to work.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wZk0ybFJWSHAyWkRWS1RHbHROMjR3UWxsclNYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Kunal Kumar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-09-28T05:07:36.6118582Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Etherea Co-working offers a professional yet vibrant environment that perfectly balances productivity and comfort. The thoughtfully designed spaces, reliable amenities, and supportive community make it an ideal place to work, collaborate, and grow.” All the Staff is amazing and supportive.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kSVNsTXpVWGhCYkhad1MyNTBZMnh2TjJOUFFXYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shikhar Gupta\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-28T05:07:36.664425Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">A place with positive vibes, last Wednesday we concluded a meeting there, the place was so nice, all members had positive energy and meeting ended on a high note. Beautifully managed by the staff and the owner Nitin ji is Gem of a person. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-96\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR6OV9qbk5nEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle915.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3amppS3VqbTl1VUF4VVVzcXdDSFk4R0hzTVEwcE1GQ0VRb0NBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR6OV9qbk5nEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"piyush jain\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-09-28T05:07:36.7116071Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">A vibrant space filled with positivity, I have thoroughly enjoyed working out of my office at ETHEREA over the past almost 2 years now. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-97\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GMFZVc