0MFFYSnZjV1o0UTNFNVMxRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Joshita\"}, {\"$id\": \"33\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T05:08:40.6843075Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">An excellent co-working space that perfectly balances productivity and recreation. The workstations are comfortable, the internet is reliable, and the overall environment is professional yet vibrant. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-125\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21Sc1owaGhNVGxFUlV4WVNuSjJVa2Q1UjNkb1ZVRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1293.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aWM2ZTNCbTl1VUF4Vmp1NndDSGNZUUotSVEwcE1GQ0I4b0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21Sc1owaGhNVGxFUlV4WVNuSjJVa2Q1UjNkb1ZVRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"siddharth bansal\"}, {\"$id\": \"34\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T05:08:40.7550029Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Highly recommended!\\n\\nThis co-working space offers the perfect environment to recharge and refocus …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-126\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKelVsaE1ORkYxYUdGbldVdHhXRzA0UjJWa1YxRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1294.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aWM2ZTNCbTl1VUF4Vmp1NndDSGNZUUotSVEwcE1GQ0NJb0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKelVsaE1ORkYxYUdGbldVdHhXRzA0UjJWa1YxRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"raghav Mittal\"}, {\"$id\": \"35\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T05:08:40.8181201Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Visited Superco a couple of days ago and had a great and smooth working experience. Internet speed is good. The workspace has  a perfect vibe to work and to interact with people from different backgrounds. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-127\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taUlMycHlUbk5YZG0wd1FUaFFaWEJ0TTNWdE1HYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1295.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aWM2ZTNCbTl1VUF4Vmp1NndDSGNZUUotSVEwcE1GQ0NVb0JRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taUlMycHlUbk5YZG0wd1FUaFFaWEJ0TTNWdE1HYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pawan mundeja\"}, {\"$id\": \"36\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T05:08:40.8663512Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">My experience was soo amazing ?? here’s the vibe are soo aesthetic &amp; calming. Private meeting rooms, giving a cafeteria and shared zone that encourage both concentration and collaboration. 10/10 …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-128\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGRGF6WlhVWFUxYVZkRFNtVXRZblZwYzFndFoyYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1296.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aWM2ZTNCbTl1VUF4Vmp1NndDSGNZUUotSVEwcE1GQ0Nnb0JnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGRGF6WlhVWFUxYVZkRFNtVXRZblZwYzFndFoyYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Heba Mirza\"}, {\"$id\": \"37\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T05:08:40.9444463Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I understand why everyone keeps saying they want to work in superco. Such a different and beautiful workplace. Happy to be associated with such a futuristic company, and the workplace makes it even better! Undoubtedly the best coworking space in Noida.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oeE1tRXljMDlSTkhaelpESTRNbVJ1U21oS09GRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shashank Mehra\"}, {\"$id\": \"38\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T05:08:40.9975291Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I had a great experience at Superco - Co-working Space. The internet speed is fast and reliable, which makes working here completely stress-free. The meeting room is well-equipped and professional, perfect for client calls and discussions. Overall, it’s a comfortable and productive workspace!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xM1Vtc3lRbTlhUjIxaWVGbzRNMHhVZG14a2IzYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Tanya Chaudhry\"}, {\"$id\": \"39\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T05:08:41.0546397Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Great co-working space with a productive and well-maintained environment. The workspace is clean, well-lit, and offers reliable internet connectivity. The staff is cooperative and responsive, making day-to-day work smooth and hassle-free. Overall, a comfortable and professional setup suitable for individuals, startups, and small teams.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4emJVZDFSMHBHVW01dWJIWTFVMVE0VkdaUU4yYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Srishti Jain\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"6th Floor, Galaxy Blue Sapphire Plaza, Plot No. C-03, Greater Noida W Rd, Haibatpur, Sector 4, Ghaziabad, Uttar Pradesh 201309\", \"Website\": \"superco.work\", \"Latitude\": 28.6072834, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/superco/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390cefb7d94759d3:0x633962a195db0eca!8m2!3d28.6072834!4d77.4354405!16s%2Fg%2F11ywp2dsgr!19sChIJ01lH2bfvDDkRyg7blaFiOWM?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1\", \"AvgRating\": 4.9, \"Longitude\": 77.4354405, \"NameHindi\": \"सुपरको\", \"Description\": \"\", \"WebsiteLink\": \"https://superco.work/\", \"TotalReviews\": 85, \"BusinessHours\": {\"$id\": \"18\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"19\", \"Hours\": {\"$id\": \"20\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"21\", \"Day\": \"Monday\", \"Time\": \"8 am–4:30 am\"}, {\"$id\": \"22\", \"Day\": \"Tuesday\", \"Time\":