e\": \"2023-05-28T05:10:40.2328515Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">You can trust them and their staff with about everything!\\n\\nI adore the space, other coworkers and their all time availability, making sure …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-176\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURlM2JiYUJnEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1848.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3anh2UHI2bTl1VUF4V0d0NndDSFVIckNaVVEwcE1GQ0FVb0FRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURlM2JiYUJnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Harsh kumar\"}, {\"$id\": \"18\", \"Date\": \"2023-05-28T05:10:40.2865871Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I am being treated nicely by all the staff members , i really like coming here due to it\'s calm environment , and the space provided here is excellent , the chill space , cafetaria , everything is phenomenal . Earlier I didn\'t expect this much but I was wrong . If anyone is considering joining , go for it.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR1ME5TVm53RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Chaitanya Arora\"}, {\"$id\": \"19\", \"Date\": \"2023-05-28T05:10:40.3687157Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">One of the best libraries, especially the co-working space! Great space, good quality chairs and a perfect environment to study!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURlM1lTZjRBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Ritesh Rathee\"}, {\"$id\": \"20\", \"Date\": \"2022-05-28T05:10:40.4233584Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I am an advocate. I used this place to work on a serious case. The atmosphere was really conducive to my needs.  I could do focused work.  Loved it.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNtaUltN0xREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Ramesh Chand Aggarwal\"}, {\"$id\": \"21\", \"Date\": \"2023-05-28T05:10:40.4743365Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Very nice and peaceful place for studing and working\\nManagement is very nice, friendly and supportive</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURPa0tHT2FREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pankaj yadav\"}, {\"$id\": \"22\", \"Date\": \"2024-05-28T05:10:40.5606986Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It was nice being there for the work. It was quite and work friendly.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKbTV5RHB3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Ankit Dayal\"}, {\"$id\": \"23\", \"Date\": \"2023-05-28T05:10:40.6124821Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Very good environment for study as well as good co working space.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN1NDdfdDJ3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"tarun mawai\"}, {\"$id\": \"24\", \"Date\": \"2023-05-28T05:10:40.6644179Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Good place to work or study.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNlOWYyWGRBEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"ADARSH SINGH\"}, {\"$id\": \"25\", \"Date\": \"2022-05-28T05:10:40.7131662Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Professional and responsible staff. Geniune prices. Keep it up ? …</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNtaUpTdVJREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Lalit Kumar\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"3rd floor, KB Complex, Pocket F, Block F, Sector Alpha II, Greater Noida, Brahmpur Rajraula Urf Nawada, Uttar Pradesh 201310\", \"Website\": \"\", \"Latitude\": 28.4775693, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Pragya+elite+co-working+spaces/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390cebe69ba5e8ef:0x5ba4d5e5f22cc5da!8m2!3d28.4775693!4d77.5171209!16s%2Fg%2F11sh22mrwj!19sChIJ7-ilm-brDDkR2sUs8uXVpFs?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1\", \"A