an><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-48\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tNeldGZ3RSekZJYUdOMFNuaEJhRXBCUjBrMmJHYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle589.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ai05OFN6bmR1VUF4VXBzS3dDSFZKcUZpZ1EwcE1GQ0FJb0FBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tNeldGZ3RSekZJYUdOMFNuaEJhRXBCUjBrMmJHYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"SHASHANK\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-01-28T05:17:06.4230568Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Cofynd makes finding coworking spaces and offices super easy. Great options, clear pricing, and very helpful support. Perfect platform for startups, freelancers, and growing teams. Highly recommend ...</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKeVluVllkM0ZuV0RRelUxaHdNakIzTUVaa2RGRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Prince Soni\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-02-28T05:17:06.4936963Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Excellent experience using this co-working space for our GST registration. The entire process was fully online, fast, and hassle-free. They provided all required documentation (NOC, Agreement, Utility Bill) within 5-7 working days. Highly recommended for startups and freelancers looking for a legitimate virtual office solution.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGNmJqa3phREZWWm5CTE4xSnlORWhwU0RSelFtYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Akshay Jain\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-03-28T05:17:06.5438661Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Great platform for Cowoking space . Had a wonderful experience as I found suitable place for my office.  The team helps with all the queries and fulfill requirements. Overall good place to contact.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25sbFJIaHpOVWhvWkdjNWFWZDJVMUYyU0daWk5YYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Simrandeep Kaur\"}, {\"