ZncmZWbmR1VUF4V01tNndDSFU1RUs4VVEwcE1GQ0FJb0FBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GVVVtZDJSMHB4WTBkUWIwaE9UMHREUVdnMldFRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Rohit Sharma\"}, {\"$id\": \"36\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T05:18:17.5407667Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Execube Coworking is a great place to work with an energetic and positive vibe. The space is well maintained, the team is supportive, and the ambience is excellent. Musician Monday is really fun, Fun Friday activities keep the environment lively, and the overall aesthetic of the place makes working here enjoyable. Highly recommended!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5U1gxZzVaMlpNWWtwSFRpMDNkR2hQYmxRNVdYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Nishant Mittal\"}, {\"$id\": \"37\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-28T05:18:17.5932713Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It’s been almost seven months since I started working at Execube Co-work, and it has truly been a great experience. I absolutely love the vibe here the energy, the atmosphere, and especially the live music sessions they’ve started recently. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-90\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5NGNVVkJUbTFtZVRoNk1tWm1URFZ2TUdod1kwRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1015.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aTZncmZWbmR1VUF4V01tNndDSFU1RUs4VVEwcE1GQ0Fnb0FnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5NGNVVkJUbTFtZVRoNk1tWm1URFZ2TUdod1kwRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Rakhi Mishra\"}, {\"$id\": \"38\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T05:18:17.6675342Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Execube Co-Work is a great place to work from. The space is clean, well-maintained, and very comfortable for daily work. Internet speed is good, seating is ergonomic, and the overall environment is professional yet friendly. Highly recommended for startups and freelancers.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGRlZFNW1lbE56ZFZCWFlYWkpTVEkxVERScVdYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"aarushi sharma\"}, {\"$id\": \"39\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T05:18:17.7194397Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Most coworking spaces are overpriced, but Execube Cowork truly understands startups. Beautiful design, comfortable desks, positive vibe, and very reasonable pricing. A great place to work and grow.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOTmFFWm1Tek4yZEZCWlVXSk9jMkZhTVdKVVlVRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"3001 Sapna Kumari\"}, {\"$id\": \"40\", \"Date\": \"2025-11-28T05:18:17.8010731Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Great coworking space with a productive vibe and modern facilities. The ambience is bright, the seating is comfortable, and the team is always helpful. Perfect for focused work and meetings. Highly recommended!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWWGJsRXpTRTE1VWxKcmNrdHdSRXg1VURRMFZXYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Adhvan Experiences\"}, {\"$id\": \"41\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T05:18:17.8521244Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I’ve had a really smooth experience at Execube Co-Work. The staff is supportive, amenities are well managed, and the workspace has a positive vibe that helps with productivity. It’s a perfect coworking space for teams as well as individuals.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tJNVUwUklPVTVIYW5wNU5GSnZaRmwxVXpCTFExRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Zeba Firdaus\"}, {\"$id\": \"42\", \"Date\": \"2025-11-28T05:18:17.9066642Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Excube Co-working is an excellent workspace for anyone looking for a productive, modern, and comfortable environment. The ambience is clean, well-designed, and perfect for both individual work and team collaboration. The staff is extremely supportive, professional, and always ready to help with anything you need.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xVNGJUUlBUazVDWlhOaGFVdG1TVk01ZG1FMFJIYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"sanjay sharma\"}, {\"$id\": \"43\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T05:18:17.988091Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Perfect place to work on a startup. Quiet when needed, collaborative when you want to network. Internet speed is solid and the workspace is well maintained.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWRGREQlJRVU5PUm5NdFNGODFXV0pLUm1oMWJFRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Abhishek kumar\"}, {\"$id\": \"44\", \"Date\": \"2025-10-28T05:18:18.0397865Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It’s such a nice place to work at  I love the vibe, the interior, and the music. They have live music every month, and the events and overall atmosphere are just so cool!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tvNVVEWjZWVUprWTFKdlNTMUxOVzVoZDIxS1drRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pratyush Baunthiyal\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"3\", \"Url\": \"https://wa.link/iutgmd\", \"Name\": \"Open booking link\"}]}, \"Address\": \"A3, Block A, Sector 4, Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201301\", \"Website\": \"execubecowork.com\", \"Latitude\": 28.5807566, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Execube+Cowork+Noida+Sector+4:+Coworking+Space+and+Workspace+Solutions/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390ce5263e9913d9:0x2c585f498ae65461!8m2!3d28.5807566!4d77.3228296!16s%2Fg%2F11h0bwfxjt!19sChIJ2ROZPiblDDkRYVTmiklfWCw?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1\", \"AvgRating\": 4.7, \"Longitude\": 77.3228296, \"NameHindi\": \"एग्जीक्यूब कॉवर्क नोएडा सेक्टर 4: कॉवर्किंग स्पेस एंड वर्कस्पेस सॉल्यूशंस\", \"Description\": \"\", \"WebsiteLink\": \"https://execubecowork.com/\", \"TotalReviews\": 214, \"BusinessHours\": {\"$id\": \"23\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"24\", \"Hours\": {\"$id\": \"25\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"26\", \"Day\": \"Monday\", \"Time\": \"8 am–8 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"27\", \"Day\": \"Tuesday\", \"Time\": \"8 am–8 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"28\", \"Day\": \"Wednesday\", \"Time\": \"8 am–8 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"29\", \"Day\": \"Thursday\", \"Time\": \"8 am–8 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"30\", \"Day\": \"Friday\", \"Time\": \"8 am–8 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"31\", \"Day\": \"Saturday\", \"Time\": \"8 am–8 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"32\", \"Day\": \"Sunday\", \"Time\": \"Closed\"}]}, \"Category\": \"More\"}]}}','2026-05-28 10:48:41',0,28.5807566,77.3228296,1),
(1098,'google-cid:0x390ce59d528f4991:0x11e4ee9124192932',28689,'WeWork Berger Delhi One','वीवर्क','Floor 19, C-001/A2, Sector 16B, Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201301','1800 123 999 000','wework.com','https://www.wework.com/buildings/berger-delhi-one--noida?utm_source=Google&utm_campaign=Organic&utm_medium=Listings','',4.50,587,'','https://www.google.com/maps/place/WeWork+Berger+Delhi+One/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390ce59d528f4991:0x11e4ee9124192932!8m2!3d28.5741187!4d77.3136442!16s%2Fg%2F11h56d3jmh!19sChIJkUmPUp3lDDkRMikZJJHu5BE?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1','[]','[{\"Key\": \"address\", \"Value\": [\"Address: Floor 19, C-001/A2, Sector 16B, Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201301\"]}, {\"Key\": \"locatedin\", \"Value\": [\"Located in: Berger Tower\"]}, {\"Key\": \"authority\", \"Value\": [\"Website: wework.com\"]}, {\"Key\": \"phone:tel:1800123999000\", \"Value\": [\"Phone: 1800 123 999 000\"]}, {\"Key\": \"oloc\", \"Value\": [\"Plus code: H8F7+JF Noida, Uttar Pradesh\"]}, {\"Key\": \"Accessibility\", \"Value\": [\"No wheelchair-accessible car park\", \"No wheelchair-accessible entrance\", \"No wheelchair-accessible seating\", \"No wheelchair-accessible toilet\"]}, {\"Key\": \"Service options\", \"Value\": [\"On-site services available\"]}, {\"Key\": \"Crowd\", \"Value\": [\"LGBTQ+ friendly\"]}, {\"Key\": \"Parking\", \"Value\": [\"Free parking lot\", \"On-site parking\", \"Paid parking lot\", \"Paid street parking\"]}]','[{\"Hours\": [{\"Day\": \"Monday\", \"Time\": \"9 am–6 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Tuesday\", \"Time\": \"9 am–6 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Wednesday\", \"Time\": \"9 am–6 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Thursday\", \"Time\": \"9 am–6 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Friday\", \"Time\": \"9 am–6 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Saturday\", \"Time\": \"Closed\"}, {\"Day\": \"Sunday\", \"Time\": \"Closed\"}], \"Category\": \"More\"}]','{\"Reviews\": [{\"Date\": \"2026-01-28T05:19:37.4385568Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Excellent co-working space with premium facilities and strong community culture\\n\\nI have been working from WeWork, Sector 16 (Noida) for nearly two years, and it …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-128\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKemRuaG1OaTFHYlhoR1pGaHhlSGhoUWpkd2JHYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1398.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUNxODc3bmR1VUF4Vmp1NndDSFlhbUw5SVEwcE1GQ0FJb0FBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKemRuaG1OaTFHYlhoR1pGaHhlSGhoUWpkd2JHYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Krish Dagar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-05-28T05:19:37.4967526Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The building is a shared office for corporate businesses, and you have to book slots to get access to spaces. The building infrastructure is great, and when I first visited, I needed to register myself(with my picture taken via camera) at …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-129\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4cWZxMTNRRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1399.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUNxODc3bmR1VUF4Vmp1NndDSFlhbUw5SVEwcE1GQ0Jjb0FRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4cWZxMTNRRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Ankit\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-12-28T05:19:39.6043716Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Awful. Don\'t bother. Whoever designed this space deserves \'genius of the year\' award (note the sarcasm). No charging ports in the phone booth, limited charging in the main office space. It feels as though the layout was created without …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-130\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kV1RuTnJkQzE2TkVOSWVFNUVUVnB0ZVRFemVtYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1400.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUNxODc3bmR1VUF4Vmp1NndDSFlhbUw5SVEwcE1GQ0NBb0FnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kV1RuTnJkQzE2TkVOSWVFNUVUVnB0ZVRFemVtYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pratiksha Khanduri\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-05-28T05:19:39.6608922Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It\'s an excellent workplace with a pleasant office environment that fosters productivity and a positive atmosphere. The surroundings contribute to a sense of well-being and inspiration, making it a truly enjoyable place to work.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUREN1B6aDhBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Vivek Kumar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-02-28T05:19:39.747253Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Great place , great community team.\\nDoes get busy sometimes do not reach too late finding a place might be difficult</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1dVRESnBZV1JHWkdkd2VVbEtSMGxZT0dSb1IwRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Kaif Ahmad\"}, {\"Date\": \"2020-05-28T05:19:39.8064517Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">No need to explain such cool co-working place.\\nAmazing and beautiful From inside and outside of building. They having MNCs office in there premises at this place. This is new place with reasonable and …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-133\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURNeTlfUXNRRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1403.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUNxODc3bmR1VUF4Vmp1NndDSFlhbUw5SVEwcE1GQ0RVb0JRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURNeTlfUXNRRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sushant Shukla\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-12-28T05:19:39.8566077Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Office space is good , but getting parking as visitor is painful. They let you enter inside the parking area and ask to return because of non availability of parking space , better to inform this at the main entry gate.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 2, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25STE4wOVNPWFYzZFhKZlExZERVMnBDTWsxM2JFRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Rehan Alam\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-28T05:19:39.9131496Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">excellent office spaces but while there is a great parking facility available, it’s limited and tends to fill up fast in the morning itself, plan accordingly if visiting!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOV1JVZDRjVk41V1VscVdsbHpXUzFrU0d4c1lrRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Viraj Gupta\"}, {\"Date\": \"2023-05-28T05:19:40.0138272Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Very well constructed, ample space, beautification done, place for restaurant, grocery and lots of office. I have visited this place for couple of time and liked it</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNPbHE2ejR3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Himendra Yadav\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-05-28T05:19:40.0751494Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The building is a shared office for corporate businesses with bookable spaces. Registration with a photo is required at reception. The impressive 15-floor building features an excellent lift system.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwNFliQWlRRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Ranjeet Singh\"}], \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}','[{\"LargeUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAG5S4jirdV6xtJ6x4yBLfO3eYbIOCLffWYQPIWI0JeEEbv58lue9fDOv5xhW9ys5fDyXNPlbUlrn1ey2hfxmgZ_bkqYroX3wod2zntv0DiCKTihPU--AQzjWarW3Z_Mc0j3inWRfA=s508-k-no\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAG5S4jirdV6xtJ6x4yBLfO3eYbIOCLffWYQPIWI0JeEEbv58lue9fDOv5xhW9ys5fDyXNPlbUlrn1ey2hfxmgZ_bkqYroX3wod2zntv0DiCKTihPU--AQzjW