\"Apurav Kumar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2020-05-28T05:23:33.1418008Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">One of the best coworking space in noida . Walking from sector 59 metro station. They have their own foodcourt also . Table tennis is also their for coworkers on rooftop. Best option</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURjeEpTNmdRRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Rahul Narang\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-05-28T05:23:35.2330338Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Do not book this office for hotdesk as they will provide you cabin in front of the reception where air condition is not working at all. When I asked to provide another room, he gave me stupid reason that we have only this space free and …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-253\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKMl9UcUJREAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2627.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ajgzT1hybnR1VUF4VkpycXdDSGJXUkQ5c1EwcE1GQ0Vzb0JRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKMl9UcUJREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Ankit Jain\"}, {\"Date\": \"2021-05-28T05:23:35.2949446Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Very nice co-working , Awesome behavior of this Co-working Staff, office. Interior is very good Sagar Sir is Very friendly nature. I will highly recommended to all. please must visit this Office.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURTZ2FHQU5nEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"nafees ahmad\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-28T05:23:35.3993794Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I’ve had a wonderful experience working at Let’s Connect Noida! The coworking space is well equipped with top notch infrastructure, high-speed internet, meeting rooms etc. You get flexible seating options which makes it ideal for both …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\