aches us really good and also acts humorous sometimes.\\nHe mainly teaches us science and mathematics. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-49\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWSWFXUm9aR0pGYWtoUmRrb3pZMkpWZVZOd2EwRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle571.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aW9nczZSbzl1VUF4VTJzYXdDSFRtRkp0Y1EwcE1GQ0FVb0FRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWSWFXUm9aR0pGYWtoUmRrb3pZMkpWZVZOd2EwRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Atharv Punetha\"}, {\"$id\": \"30\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-28T05:42:46.9066586Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It is my first time taking tuitons and what an experience it is. The teacher, Shivam sir teaches well and clears doubt very quickly and clearly. Sir is very hospitable but have one problem, they are VERY PARTICULAR about being on time. Even …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-50\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2trMlYxZEZRa0ZLY0Y5MVdXSkRMVXQxZUdreVdHYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle572.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aW9nczZSbzl1VUF4VTJzYXdDSFRtRkp0Y1EwcE1GQ0Fnb0FnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2trMlYxZEZRa0ZLY0Y5MVdXSkRMVXQxZUdreVdHYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Harshehzad Singh\"}, {\"$id\": \"31\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-28T05:42:46.9562394Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Eklavya Classes provides excellent home tutoring for Class 10 Maths and Science. The tutor explains concepts in a very clear and simple manner, making even difficult topics easy to understand. With personal attention, regular practice, and …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-51\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnME5FMUxSMGRwV0haeFZWUXdNbkUyUzFjM1pHYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle573.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aW9nczZSbzl1VUF4VTJzYXdDSFRtRkp0Y1EwcE1GQ0Fzb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnME5FMUxSMGRwV0haeFZWUXdNbkUyUzFjM1pHYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Nisha Chandra\"}, {\"$id\": \"32\", \"Date\": \"2025-10-28T05:42:47.0233966Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Shivam sir is truly excellent. He not only teaches concepts in a clear and simple way but also conducts regular tests and provides worksheets that strengthen our learning. He guides us with patience, gives individual attention, and even …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-52\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wbVZYcHFhVTVNVGtvMFUwUlZXR3BHUzBORmIwRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle574.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aW9nczZSbzl1VUF4VTJzYXdDSFRtRkp0Y1EwcE1GQ0E0b0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wbVZYcHFhVTVNVGtvMFUwUlZXR3BHUzBORmIwRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Ruby Rai\"}, {\"$id\": \"33\", \"Date\": \"2026-01-28T05:42:47.0795847Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I am grateful to have guideline from shivam sir. Explanations are clear, simple, and easy to understand. Doubts are always solved patiently, and extra effort is taken to make sure every topic is well understood.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xjMWMyZGpNWGsyUm5Cc1VtOXlOVFV6WmkxdVZYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Yuvraj Kumar\"}, {\"$id\": \"34\", \"Date\": \"2025-09-28T05:42:47.1480328Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Shivam sir is an excellent teacher, has vast knowledge and make it seamless for the kids to grasp the concept. He puts extra time and efforts to make each child improve in every aspect whether it is concept clarity, timing, working on silly mistakes, practising sample papers etc. Highly recommended for students of class 9th till 12th.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxMlMyVlJZMGQwWVhWTlFsaExORFoxWWpoUFgwRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sonia Khatri\"}, {\"$id\": \"35\", \"Date\": \"2025-09-28T05:42:47.1940006Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Learning with Shivam Sir has been a great experience. He explains things clearly. He breaks down complicated problems into simple, manageable steps. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-55\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xjeGVsWTFTbXd6ZEVZMWJVZHFkbU5GVmtkaWRGRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle577.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aW9nczZSbzl1VUF4VTJzYXdDSFRtRkp0Y1EwcE1GQ0Jjb0J3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xjeGVsWTFTbXd6ZEVZMWJVZHFkbU5GVmtkaWRGRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shreya Singh\"}, {\"$id\": \"36\", \"Date\": \"2025-11-28T05:42:47.2430388Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">An outstanding math teacher who explains every concept with clarity and patience. Their teaching makes even the most difficult topics easy to understand and enjoyable to learn.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKMlUwSm9aVlpuT1dkWVZYRk9ibkpWY25OV2RsRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"varnavi\"}, {\"$id\": \"37\", \"Date\": \"2025-07-28T05:42:47.3164789Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Shivam Sir is one of the best mathematics teachers I\'ve come across. His way of teaching is clear, engaging, and easy to understand, no matter how difficult the topic is. He focuses on building strong fundamentals, which really helps in …</s