Date\": \"2019-05-28T05:48:56.1861235Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">One of the best Avenues in Gaur City having independent entrance and exit surrounded with markets all sides. City Plaza, Mahagun Mart, City Galleria market all surrounding.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNJaWFLakVBEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Mayank Explorer\"}, {\"Date\": \"2019-05-28T05:48:56.2407633Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It\'s a good society to live in. Two malls are nearby where household goods are easily accessible. Good secure place for women. Flats are also specious and built quality is also very good. Gym, pharmacy, doctor\'s chamber everything is nearby. There is intercom in every flats. Overall it\'s a very good place for living.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNJd3NtXzFRRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Rupa Datta Choudhury\"}, {\"Date\": \"2019-05-28T05:48:56.3276404Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I lived there for 6 months and had mixed experience . Only thing i didn\'t liked was over framed maintenance charges which was complete nonsense as it was forcely applicable and no facilities are provided no Gym , No community service , …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-236\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNJdG9XYWxRRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2193.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3anR6cHZDcE51VUF4V3B1YXdDSFV0Vkp3WVEwcE1GQ0hzb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 3, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNJdG9XYWxRRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Atul Shukla\"}, {\"Date\": \"2019-05-28T05:48:56.3769812Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Very neat and clean society.. Build by Gaur\'s builder.. Swimming pool, organized open and cover parking, guest parking, location is very good located in gaur city 2 noida extension, only one drawback there is no club and gym in this society..</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNJODd5NE9REAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Siddhartha Tomer\"}, {\"Date\": \"2016-05-28T05:48:56.4309938Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Lovely Place with kids play area and swimming pool and a small city plaza mall nearby for shopping. Good lift facility. Highly secured area with CCTV , basement parking , good place for morning and night walk and much more.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNncE1PLVVREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Asif Khan\"}, {\"Date\": \"2019-05-28T05:48:56.5179218Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Sanskari vihar it is Avery good palace. Here you can get all thing . Here  is very good atmosphere and voor faculty good staff . All things are very good here. I am fully satisfied from this place . So I am giving four out of five points. Thank you for reading my reviews for Sanskari vihar,10th revenue</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNJNHEzQWlBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Rahul Sharma\"}, {\"Date\": \"2019-05-28T05:48:56.5691669Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Very small apartments. Lack of sunlight and fresh air. Security is good</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 3, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURJbkxMS3pRRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Deepti Vishnoi\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-05-28T05:48:58.6552757Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Th teacher doesnt know anything very pathetic teaching quality please dont send your children there</span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ5dGJybmhRRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Susmita Dutta gupta\"}, {\"Date\": \"2019-05-28T05:48:58.7597435Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Decent avenue but lack some facilities like gym, party hall etc.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 3, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNJeThuV1pnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Tushar Ch