both academic excellence and the overall well-being of students makes it a preferred choice for many aspiring learners.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3Z1lMVHZ3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Anshit Gumber\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-28T05:50:16.3535691Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">GradSure has truly helped me grow, both academically and personally. The coaching is well-structured, and the focus on understanding concepts rather than just memorizing makes a big difference. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-274\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VQbmE3WU9IcHFiOFp3EAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2571.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXU3N1hvcE51VUF4V0N1NndDSFl2Y0dEMFEwcE1GQ0Frb0FRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VQbmE3WU9IcHFiOFp3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"NICK LEGEND\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-28T05:50:16.4476046Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The campus facilities are top-notch, creating an ideal environment for learning and personal growth. What really sets this institution apart, however, is the sense of community. Mentors are genuinely invested in student success, and there …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-275\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3X05UYmFnEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2572.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXU3N1hvcE51VUF4V0N1NndDSFl2Y0dEMFEwcE1GQ0F3b0FnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3X05UYmFnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Purshotam Yadav\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-28T05:50:16.4961978Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It’s has really helped me understand my subject better. The teachers explain everything clearly. I have improved a lot since I joined.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25sVVJtVkZaa3hTYm1wd2JFTTJRVmhMUlROTFdrRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Aradhya\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-28T05:50:16.5462364Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">GradSure is the epitome of excellence in education. From highly qualified faculty to a well-structured curriculum, every aspect of this institute is designed to ensure student success. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-277\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3cTlXTDdnRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2574.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXU3N1hvcE51VUF4V0N1NndDSFl2Y0dEMFEwcE1GQ0JJb0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3cTlXTDdnRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"harshit khurana\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-12-28T05:50:16.6002122Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Very nice teachers and study environment, guiding on the correct path</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkNlgyOWhjVk5FUm1wSFNYWnZWbFJNUVcxelprRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Devdeep B\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-28T05:50:16.692175Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Outstanding coaching faculty and Top Notch Teachers especially Kapil Sir</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKbk4yTk9PV3MyZFhWdVRXUmpTMjR4V0RWaFVFRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Dhruv Indu\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-28T05:50:16.7479862Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Great institute for various subjects available in India .</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wd2QyZElZa3d0ZGt4aGVURjNaek5oYUVSeldFRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Aahan Khanna\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-28T05:50:16.8028098Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I feel it\'s one of the b