E\", \"Reviewer\": \"Kartikeyan sahai\"}, {\"Date\": \"2023-05-28T06:34:32.6088968Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The syllabus is covered completely and teacher takes care of your doubts and also takes care of your time frame in case you want to study for a month or so. The management is also very good and schedules classes according to your …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-213\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURRLXN5X0hBEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2162.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3anUxTHJhcnR1VUF4VTh1YXdDSFdnRENpc1EwcE1GQ0E0b0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURRLXN5X0hBEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Venkatesh Sreedhar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2023-05-28T06:34:32.6611245Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It\'s was excellent experience there. Environment is very good. Classes not crowded. Teacher with good experience and knowledge. I completed my c from there. And now my all concept of c are clear. Highly recommend. Plus management is too good. Teachers are gentle and very hardworking. Must join</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNJc3MtX053EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shivanshu Pathak\"}, {\"Date\": \"2023-05-28T06:34:32.7078505Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">For a B. TECH students like myself,\\nIt has extremely flexible timings which can be stretched till 7 pm is really very handy. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-215\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNBOEktYTRnRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2164.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3anUxTHJhcnR1VUF4VTh1YXdDSFdnRENpc1EwcE1GQ0JRb0JnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdD