": \"\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAHDpqabvWPnf-VEXqXgPv6TyyQKr_rw8lZfrvvGgcUapN2CohQBm4b-xArmgRc7B_RJGk494of1pBE-2R5OhO3B9wJE1XJGb7q93l0pxr41QroGqx0QF43QJe9kFKMEhxiuIaZFsQ=w203-h152-k-no\"}]}, \"Phone\": \"\", \"Review\": {\"$id\": \"24\", \"Reviews\": {\"$id\": \"25\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"26\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T07:44:50.0903261Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Very disappointing academic management. The college changes student sections every semester, which creates unnecessary stress and emotional instability. Just when students adjust to their classmates, teachers, and learning environment, …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-48\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkNmVFaEVPVmhQU1hOTFFWZzRZMXBEZUU5UWNVRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle528.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUp1TnEwdnR1VUF4VXBzS3dDSFZKcUZpZ1EwcE1GQ0FJb0FBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkNmVFaEVPVmhQU1hOTFFWZzRZMXBEZUU5UWNVRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Hello Hi\"}, {\"$id\": \"27\", \"Date\": \"2026-01-28T07:44:50.1514979Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">ABES Engineering College is known for technical education and professional training.\\nThe campus offers an inspiring learning environment, and the staff and faculty …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-49\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GdWJWQjVNRkJRZUhCcVNsbzFTM290YzNNek1YYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle529.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUp1TnEwdnR1VUF4VXBzS3dDSFZKcUZpZ1EwcE1GQ0FVb0FRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GdWJWQjVNRkJRZUhCcVNsbzFTM290YzNNek1YYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Praveen Siyak Bishnoi\"}, {\"$id\": \"28\", \"Date\": \"2023-05-28T07:44:50.2313006Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Nice college for doing B.Tech.It is one of the best college of AKTU. Teachers are also good. Great placement support. Placement team gives nice training during the whole placement season. Companies starting from  4lpa to 15 lpa come in campus. This college is recommended if one want to do B.Tech from AKTU.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNva3FPZjBnRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Mayank Gupta\"}, {\"$id\": \"29\", \"Date\": \"2023-05-28T07:44:50.2821299Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Good engineering college in Ghaziabad. You will get this private on good rank. This is private collage and it’s on the road. Anytime you can come here because availability of transportation. I would recommend this collage if you are getting CS/IT branch here.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4aC1HQ2xBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shane Aalam\"}, {\"$id\": \"30\", \"Date\": \"2021-05-28T07:44:50.3498134Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">My Experience (2010-2014):\\nThe college infrastructure is really good.\\nIt has maintained the greenery inside the campus. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-52\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN5cHZIZ0lREAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle532.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUp1TnEwdnR1VUF4VXBzS3dDSFZKcUZpZ1EwcE1GQ0NBb0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN5cHZIZ0lREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Hemant Teotia\"}, {\"$id\": \"31\", \"Date\": \"2020-05-28T07:44:50.4000761Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">This college is considered as the best college in Delhi NCR .The  college infrastructure is better as compared to other colleges.\\nThe location of the college is good for the students living in hostel but the …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-53\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQwNm9tWHhnRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle533.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUp1TnEwdnR1VUF4VXBzS3dDSFZKcUZpZ1EwcE1GQ0Rrb0JRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQwNm9tWHhnRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Akash Srivastava\"}, {\"$id\": \"32\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-28T07:44:50.4720835Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Quit good college in terms of study only not in terms of fest and events . The college is good in terms of cleanliness and good environment of study .</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 3, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNJMUlLaEFnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Om jee Rai\"}, {\"$id\": \"33\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-28T07:44:52.5711607Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Worst experience in the college. They treat students like shit . Too much pressure for attendance even for genuine reasons. Do not provide exemption even for important events in college. Also the Teachers are not experienced enough. The just come and start reading the ppt and write codes without giving proper explanation.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paelZ6SkNXSEpNVFdGMlYzSlJiVjg1T1ZCM1JtYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Daksh Sharma\"}, {\"$id\": \"34\", \"Date\": \"2021-05-28T07:44:52.6197488Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It is one of the top college in NCR specifically in Ghaziabad it ranks among top 10. Also it is one of the biggest college in Ghaziabad in area. The architecture of the college is also good than other colleges with great classrooms, facilities etc. This college is on national highway 24 and nearby to Vijaynagar and Lal Kuan.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNDaXRhODV3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Bharat Tyagi\"}, {\"$id\": \"35\", \"Date\": \"2018-05-28T07:44:52.6972555Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I think its one of the toppest calleg3 in delhi NCR. Nice placement nice staff and nice teaching method.Nice location . It is the best engineering callege. And the mist knowable point is it has 1st rank in UP and 5 rank in india in \\\"Swachh Bharat Abhiyan\\\" If you like my review than thanks alot. plz like my review.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURBckxqaUVBEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Govind\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"Dundahera, Ghaziabad, Uttar Pradesh 201009\", \"Website\": \"abes.ac\", \"Latitude\": 28.6340537, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/ABES+Engineering+College/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390cee22c60837b7:0x7c35343eceb7bde0!8m2!3d28.6340537!4d77.4455928!16s%2Fm%2F0jk_wyv!19sChIJtzcIxiLuDDkR4L23zj40NXw?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1\", \"AvgRating\": 4.0, \"Longitude\": 77.4455928, \"NameHindi\": \"एब्स इंजीनियरिंग कॉलेज\", \"Description\": \"\", \"WebsiteLink\": \"https://abes.ac.in/\", \"TotalReviews\": 286, \"BusinessHours\": {\"$id\": \"14\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"15\", \"Hours\": {\"$id\": \"16\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"17\", \"Day\": \"Monday\", \"Time\": \"8:30 am–5 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"18\", \"Day\": \"Tuesday\", \"Time\": \"8:30 am–5 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"19\", \"Day\": \"Wednesday\", \"Time\": \"8:30 am–5 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"20\", \"Day\": \"Thursday\", \"Time\": \"8:30 am–5 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"21\", \"Day\": \"Friday\", \"Time\": \"8:30 am–5 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"22\", \"Day\": \"Saturday\", \"Time\": \"8:30 am–5 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"23\", \"Day\": \"Sunday\", \"Time\": \"Closed\"}]}, \"Category\": \"More\"}]}}','2026-05-28 13:15:13',0,28.6340537,77.4455928,1),
