tical knowledge and practical exposure. as a student of this university i would like to share my honest.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tRNWVISnNlVWxQTkVwSldFdGxSa1pNYTJod2MyYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Zubair Khan\"}, {\"$id\": \"32\", \"Date\": \"2025-07-28T07:47:01.0818536Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Placement records are decent, with companies visiting for recruitment. The training sessions for interviews and resumes are useful, but stronger industry connections could boost opportunities further. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-120\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ZeWNXczJTVWx2YmtoUmVEZENXSE41VDFGamJHYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1299.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aWNnSVgwdnR1VUF4VS11cXdDSGRTcE9hRVEwcE1GQ0RJb0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ZeWNXczJTVWx2YmtoUmVEZENXSE41VDFGamJHYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Neha Nagar\"}, {\"$id\": \"33\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-28T07:47:01.1273317Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Faculty of life science\\n(Department of forensic sciene) HRIT UNIVERSITY …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-121\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCRWIxQmFhMVk1ZW5WSU1qVm9TMHRyWkRkU1VIYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1300.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aWNnSVgwdnR1VUF4VS11cXdDSGRTcE9hRVEwcE1GQ0Rrb0JRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCRWIxQmFhMVk1ZW5WSU1qVm9TMHRyWkRkU1VIYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Khushii Tyagii\"}, {\"$id\": \"34\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-28T07:47:01.176814Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I am pursuing bsc. Forensic science  from th