es\": [{\"$id\": \"28\", \"Date\": \"2026-01-28T08:26:08.1194754Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Worst Experience at KCC – Disappointing Exam Centre\\n\\nMy experience at KCC as an exam centre was extremely disappointing. The …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-202\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25aV09WOVhWbmxYTVRSaWIwaHdhRTFvVTNWM1dHYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2141.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aVpsYWpTeDl1VUF4V2h0NndDSGJLdkdBd1EwcE1GQ0FJb0FBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25aV09WOVhWbmxYTVRSaWIwaHdhRTFvVTNWM1dHYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Priyanka Tiwari\"}, {\"$id\": \"29\", \"Date\": \"2024-05-28T08:26:08.2081828Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">My examination center was lying there, after entering in the college the staff did not know about the examination, so arrangements were made. The faculty are very irresponsible. So if in this case kindely visit first floor examination room, then finally they\'re shedule the exam. Toilet are too bad it\'s like government toilet.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 2, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNKeFBIRV9nRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Abdur Rahman\"}, {\"$id\": \"30\", \"Date\": \"2026-01-28T08:26:08.2569817Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">KCCITM is a well-known institute situated in 2009 by the KCC Group of Institutions in Greater Noida, UP. The institute is AKTU affiliated and AICTE approved. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-204\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKUUxVbHNOV3h2V2toM2JUWktYMDlQVG14aGRFRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2143.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aVpsYWpTeDl1VUF4V2h0NndDSGJLdkdBd1EwcE1GQ0JRb0FnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKUUxVbHNOV3h2V2toM2JUWktYMDlQVG14aGRFRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Manoj Yadav\"}, {\"$id\": \"31\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-28T08:26:10.3637834Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">As a parent, I am deeply disappointed. The academic quality and student support did not justify the fees. Placement guidance was poor, and communication from the institute was unsatisfactory. Overall, expectations were not met.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taQk1qaG5VRzF4ZFRnelkzSTJVRTFzVEU0NFdWRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Priya\"}, {\"$id\": \"32\", \"Date\": \"2026-01-28T08:26:12.4630476Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I have a bad experience with the education culture of KCC. As a parent, I am not satisfied with KCC Institute of Technology. The academic discipline was weak, communication with parents was almost nonexistent, and administrative issues took months to resolve. The overall environment did not justify.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201RFEyUlNiVUZMTmxOWFQzSnJObTEzVDBSWk0wRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"GARIMA SRIVASTAVA\"}, {\"$id\": \"33\", \"Date\": \"2025-08-28T08:26:12.5139981Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Honestly, KCC ITM and ILHE have a really nice campus vibe, the teachers are quite supportive and approachable which makes studies easier. The hostel is also good rooms are clean, food is decent and it feels safe to stay. Overall, a pretty good experience here.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kd1lsVkdZemxNTVhCUVQyOXBVeTF6VTJOdlVXYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Aditi Chaudhary\"}, {\"$id\": \"34\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-28T08:26:12.559846Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">If you are looking for cheap engineering college and have less expectations regarding your extra curricular activities you can consider KCC ITM . It\'s fees structure is less compared to other colleges and it has decent campus and they have …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-208\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJUExqdnFBNUpHMmp3RRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2147.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aVpsYWpTeDl1VUF4V2h0NndDSGJLdkdBd1EwcE1GQ0NBb0JnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 3, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJUExqdnFBNUpHMmp3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Yaar_jitu\"}, {\"$id\": \"35\", \"Date\": \"2020-05-28T08:26:12.6144015Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">KCC itm  is the best college and the social atmosphere is very good . The quality of education is nice and faculty are very supportive in nature and laboratory is also well equipped. Faculty is very supportive.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNzdHVLZ1lBEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Captain Akash\"}, {\"$id\": \"36\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-28T08:26:12.6644548Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I am proud to be a part of this institute. The infrastructure and facilities extended to students, faculty, and staff are excellent.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUN3ODZHQm5RRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Vikas Sharma\"}, {\"$id\": \"37\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T08:26:12.7513944Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I have a request to the KCC institute of technology and management. Please add a specific Cyber Security labs for BTech Students. Please ? …</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkTFZETkhZMEUwTWsxc2NqWm9lbFpoY1d0RE1YYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Dipankar Adhikary\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"2B 2C, Vashishth Rd, Knowledge Park III, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201310\", \"Website\": \"kccitm.edu\", \"L