ate\": \"2025-07-28T08:28:27.8781634Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Galgotias University offers a good blend of academics, infrastructure, and student life. The campus is modern and well-maintained, with spacious classrooms, high-speed Wi-Fi, air-conditioned libraries, and dedicated labs for each …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-275\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkamRrOVZZM2R0TkhWcUxXRndZalZTTW1rd1UxRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2878.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXd6dlNWeU51VUF4WDNpS3dDSGZXNktra1EwcE1GQ0Mwb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkamRrOVZZM2R0TkhWcUxXRndZalZTTW1rd1UxRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Logical Comrade\"}, {\"$id\": \"34\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-28T08:28:27.9275137Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I am a BCA student at Galgotias University. The college offers decent infrastructure and academic opportunities, with some supportive teachers. However, the campus environment has several issues. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-276\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURmbXZyTUdBEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2879.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXd6dlNWeU51VUF4WDNpS3dDSGZXNktra1EwcE1GQ0RJb0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURmbXZyTUdBEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Ankit\"}, {\"$id\": \"35\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-28T08:28:28.0229203Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Galgotias University in Greater Noida is known for its comprehensive academic programs and modern infrastructure. Established in 2011, it has rapidly gained recognition for its commitment to providing quality education across various …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-277\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURubWNPazVnRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2880.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXd6dlNWeU51VUF4WDNpS3dDSGZXNktra1EwcE1GQ0VFb0JRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURubWNPazVnRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Ankit Pathak\"}, {\"$id\": \"36\", \"Date\": \"2024-05-28T08:28:28.0765042Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Pretty university Infraestructura is great and you can find all the sports and extra activities stuff , student culture and activities is great but this place is far from mainland the connectivity is very poor you can\'t find auto and cabs …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-278\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMxdU5hQ0p3EAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2881.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXd6dlNWeU51VUF4WDNpS3dDSGZXNktra1EwcE1GQ0d3b0JnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMxdU5hQ0p3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Divyanshu Singh\"}, {\"$id\": \"37\", \"Date\": \"2023-05-28T08:28:28.1261535Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">As an alumni I think I have enough idea of the Institute to give you a clear perspective.\\nMany would come across individual who will have opinion about it, I would be …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-279\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURPdUtURWJ3EAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2882.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXd6dlNWeU51VUF4WDNpS3dDSGZXNktra1EwcE1GQ0lVQktBYyJd\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURPdUtURWJ3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shivam Raj1\"}, {\"$id\": \"38\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-28T08:28:28.1724353Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Galgotias has a modern campus and offers various programs. Some faculties are great, while others vary. Placement support exists but depends on the branch. Good for self-motivated students.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJdS0tNDYxbmV6VmJnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sagar Kumar\"}, {\"$id\": \"39\", \"Date\": \"2023-05-28T08:28:28.2214081Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It has a very good infrastructure, but the thing is it is located very far away from other metro stations which increases the travelling time. Also the faculties there are very helpful, so it is a good University as a private if you want to take admissions.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoMF96OG1nRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Kajal Choudhary\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"Plot No. 2, Yamuna Expy, opposite Buddha International Circuit, Sector 17A, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh 203201\", \"Website\": \"galgotiasuniversity.edu\", \"Latitude\": 28.3668904, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Galgotias+University/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390cc7365a740e65:0xd0d60a62e55ab171!8m2!3d28.3668904!4d77.5413398!16s%2Fm%2F0gff9fz!19sChIJZQ50WjbHDDkRcbFa5WIK1tA?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1\", \"AvgRating\": 3.8, \"Longitude\": 77.5413398, \"NameHindi\": \"गलगोटियास युनिवर्सिटी\", \"Description\": \"\", \"WebsiteLink\": \"https://www.galgotiasuniversity.edu.in/\", \"TotalReviews\": 168, \"BusinessHours\": {\"$id\": \"18\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"19\", \"Hours\": {\"$id\": \"20\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"21\", \"Day\": \"Monday\", \"Time\": \"8 am–6:25 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"22\", \"Day\": \"Tuesday\", \"Time\": \"8 am–6:25 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"23\", \"Day\":