ege has been truly exceptional. The faculty members are not only knowledgeable, but also deeply supportive. Peaceful environment, affiliated from GGSIPU also &amp; Grade A Campus.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KeWQzbE9MVWRIYVVNeGEyRjFWMnh4WW5oNVNFRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"maryam sajjad\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-02-28T08:30:40.554261Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Teachers in our college are friendly and helpful. They make classes easy to understand and guide students whenever needed.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCYU1qSk5ZVmxMT0Zrd1kxbGxkV2RNUVhSTVJtYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Anu Chaudhary\"}, {\"Date\": \"2023-05-28T08:30:40.615621Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">This is one of the best college for management students. They use to provide so many extra curricular activities. And the faculties are also very supportive.  The atmosphere is great around the campus. They also take us on industrial visits and several other shows.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNSNjRLQVhBEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Aman Choudhary\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-05-28T08:30:40.671593Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">GN Group of Institutes located in the area of  Knowledge Park 2,\\nGreater Noida, Delhi NCR. Good place for study. i have visited campus during the admission time. croudy campus and well maintain students.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMxMXJfblJ3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Suprakash Mishra\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-28T08:30:40.7745993Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">well maintained college in knowledge park 2 it also helps the students to gain the practical knowledge as college provides the industrial visits also which is 2 times in per sem.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKTVprTjJjMGxTZFVnMGJsZDZaemxQVVRSWE5IYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"soumya agarwal\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-10-28T08:30:40.8313714Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">one of the best college in knowledge park2 , superb facilities and understanding faculties , non toxic environment , also take us on industrial visits  and more and well maintain infrastructure</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5elNucG1RV1ZmU2poTVRGRnRhME5mZEhaUGVXYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pinki Sharma\"}, {\"Date\": \"2023-05-28T08:30:40.886403Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">There are Good infrastructure, co-operative faculties,  many industrial tour etc.\\nThere are digital library and many computer labs. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-350\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNSNl9LRnpBRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle3681.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aWdwcFhWeU51VUF4VXFyS3dDSGJuSE5YZ1EwcE1GQ0Jnb0JnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNSNl9LRnpBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Anjali Chandel\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-28T08:30:40.9428006Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">This is one of the best college in knowledge park 2 as budget friendly also , and we can get the government degree from it.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21waWNsaE9WMTltVmtKNGJuRnBSMFU0T0ZkQlkwRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"pinki sharma\"}, {\"Date\": \"2023-05-28T08:30:41.0005181Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Pharmacy college has good laboratories with best in class equipments as per the norms of PCI.\\nMost of our graduates are placed in the best of pharmaceutical companies.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoNjRYVE9REAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"PAWAN KUMAR TIWARI\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-28T08:30:41.1070645Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I 