r sem.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKTVprTjJjMGxTZFVnMGJsZDZaemxQVVRSWE5IYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"soumya agarwal\"}, {\"$id\": \"42\", \"Date\": \"2025-10-28T08:30:40.8313714Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">one of the best college in knowledge park2 , superb facilities and understanding faculties , non toxic environment , also take us on industrial visits  and more and well maintain infrastructure</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5elNucG1RV1ZmU2poTVRGRnRhME5mZEhaUGVXYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pinki Sharma\"}, {\"$id\": \"43\", \"Date\": \"2023-05-28T08:30:40.886403Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">There are Good infrastructure, co-operative faculties,  many industrial tour etc.\\nThere are digital library and many computer labs. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-350\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNSNl9LRnpBRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle3681.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aWdwcFhWeU51VUF4VXFyS3dDSGJuSE5YZ1EwcE1GQ0Jnb0JnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNSNl9LRnpBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Anjali Chandel\"}, {\"$id\": \"44\", \"Date\": \"2025-11-28T08:30:40.9428006Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">This is one of the best college in knowledge park 2 as budget friendly also , and we can get the government degree from it.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21waWNsaE9WMTltVmtKNGJuRnBSMFU0T0ZkQlkwRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"pinki sharma\"}, {\"$id\": \"45\", \"Date\": \"2023-05-28T08:30:41.0005181Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Pharmacy college has good laboratories with best in class equipments as per the norms of PCI.\\nMost of our graduates are placed in the best of pharmaceutical companies.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoNjRYVE9REAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"PAWAN KUMAR TIWARI\"}, {\"$id\": \"46\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-28T08:30:41.1070645Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I recently had the opportunity to visit the GN Group of Pharmacy college, and I was thoroughly impressed by the institution\'s commitment to providing quality education in the field of pharmacy …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-353\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3cHQyVllBEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle3684.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aWdwcFhWeU51VUF4VXFyS3dDSGJuSE5YZ1EwcE1GQ0Njb0NRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3cHQyVllBEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sahil Siddiqui\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"3\", \"Url\": \"http://www.gngroup.org/\", \"Name\": \"Open booking link\"}]}, \"Address\": \"Plot No - 6B & 6C, Knowledge Park II, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201310\", \"Website\": \"gngroup.org\", \"Latitude\": 28.4596535, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/G+N+Group+Of+Institutes+%28Knowledge+Park+-+2,+Greater+Noida,+U.P.%29/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390cc18ad7b350c9:0x9574dff27416cef!8m2!3d28.4596535!4d77.4956968!16s%2Fg%2F11fhkcj2d1!19sChIJyVCz14rBDDkR72xBJ_9NVwk?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1\", \"AvgRating\": 4.3, \"Longitude\": 77.4956968, \"NameHindi\": \"जी एन ग्रुप ऑफ़ इंस्टीटूटस ( नाॅलेज पार्क - 2, ग्रेटर नोएडा, यू.पी.)\", \"Description\": \"\", \"WebsiteLink\": \"https://www.gngroup.org/\", \"TotalReviews\": 546, \"BusinessHours\": {\"$id\": \"25\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"26\", \"Hours\": {\"$id\": \"27\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"28\", \"Day\": \"Monday\", \"Time\": \"9 am–6 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"29\", \"Day\": \"Tuesday\", \"Time