"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Sharda University is a good destination for good education in every field. The Sharda Hospital is also one of the best in the area having good infrastructure. reputed medical staff for providing very good care to the patients and their attendents.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205cGRtSmhhR2xKV25wQ1ZXRkpSRU5ZZVhrMGVrRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Anil Kumar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-28T08:41:59.5359154Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I\'m a former CSE student of Sharda and I\'m going to write an honest review about this university. If you\'re interested in placement through this college then please explore other nearby colleges.  If you are interested in living your …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-22\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQyNjUzRHlBRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle175.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3akJ0dWlZeTl1VUF4VU1sNndDSGRFbkJ3WVEwcE1GQ0VRb0NBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQyNjUzRHlBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shivam\"}, {\"Date\": \"2022-05-28T08:41:59.5891431Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Sharda University is located ahead of Greater Noida. I visited last week regarding for admission  in bca. The college fees around 5L. The placement of the college is also very good and its campus was really cool and its placement was good. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-23\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ2MWFyNXl3RRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle176.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3akJ0dWlZeTl1VUF4VU1sNndDSGRFbkJ3WVEwcE1GQ0djb0NRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUh