earby colleges.  If you are interested in living your …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-22\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQyNjUzRHlBRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle175.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3akJ0dWlZeTl1VUF4VU1sNndDSGRFbkJ3WVEwcE1GQ0VRb0NBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQyNjUzRHlBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shivam\"}, {\"$id\": \"37\", \"Date\": \"2022-05-28T08:41:59.5891431Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Sharda University is located ahead of Greater Noida. I visited last week regarding for admission  in bca. The college fees around 5L. The placement of the college is also very good and its campus was really cool and its placement was good. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-23\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ2MWFyNXl3RRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle176.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3akJ0dWlZeTl1VUF4VU1sNndDSGRFbkJ3WVEwcE1GQ0djb0NRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ2MWFyNXl3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Kamal Kishor\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"plot no 32, 34, Knowledge Park III, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201310\", \"Website\": \"sharda.ac\", \"Latitude\": 28.4730668, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Sharda+University/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390cea0f7b91511b:0x486f13bd49e5e7ae!8m2!3d28.4730668!4d77.48291!16s%2Fm%2F0bwl_4c!19sChIJG1GRew_qDDkRruflSb0Tb0g?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1\", \"AvgRating\": 4.1, \"Longitude\": 77.48291, \"NameHindi\": \"शारदा यूनिवर्सिटी\", \"Description\": \"\", \"WebsiteLink\": \"https://www.sharda.ac