week , which help in development of overall personality. I will recommend to join Jim\'s Greater Noida.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNuejlEUTdnRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Raghav Mittal\"}, {\"Date\": \"2023-05-28T08:42:59.2374361Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The infrastructure of this college is excellent. The campus is very spacious and it is also surrounded by lush green environment.  Everything is well maintained and the college has all the necessary  facilities for their students. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-50\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN1bVlXelF3EAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle518.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3amJ2cmExeTl1VUF4V1R0NndDSFVReUE4UVEwcE1GQ0JZb0FnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN1bVlXelF3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Swati\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-28T08:43:01.3525853Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">This college has turned into a school. They don\'t support the students at all and constantly create trouble for them. If you ask anything, they tell you to come later. The faculty is not supportive; they only pretend to be. It’s all just a …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-51\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURnMThHaEVnEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle519.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3amJ2cmExeTl1VUF4V1R0NndDSFVReUE4UVEwcE1GQ0Jrb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURnMThHaEVnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Kazama\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-28T08:43:03.4522491Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Extremely unprofessional and unhelpful staff of the Reception..being alumn