 to help us and motivate and guide us to do well in academic. Till now, I have good experience in GN Group.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxd2NIWk9PVnBhVkRSV2FHcEpPSEpxZW5wVk5GRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Siya Singh\"}, {\"$id\": \"26\", \"Date\": \"2026-01-28T08:45:28.4967743Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Placement opportunities are excellent with big companies coming for drives. Faculty gives good industry exposure and college environment is helpful</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkQ05IUnJjVk5tVmxoNFNtSm5jVk4yTURobVkwRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Neha Mishra\"}, {\"$id\": \"27\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-28T08:45:28.5501323Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Great college, one of the best college of engineering in greater noida.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21SUVVGQnZSbmx4T0VrNFEwRTNUM2xGYVdwWE1uYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Naaz k\"}, {\"$id\": \"28\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-28T08:45:28.6367161Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">faculties are knowledgeable and supportive as mentors. College offers value-added certification courses and organizes industrial visits which help get practical knowledge beyond theory.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wblQxRXhWSFpvVEhoTFZEWnhRVEkyTlhGamMzYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"soumya agarwal\"}, {\"$id\": \"29\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-28T08:45:28.6886706Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">campus have good classrooms, a central &amp; departmental library, computer labs, Wi-Fi, and hostel facilities. Staff and faculties are helpful and supportive.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VNU1l2TExtbnB2NDFnRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"jaya rawal\"}, {\"$id\": \"30\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-28T08:45:28.7428894Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Great institute with knowledgeable faculty and a supportive learning environm