nowledge Park II, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201310\", \"Website\": \"gnct.co\", \"Latitude\": 28.4606402, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Greater+Noida+College/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390cc1dc33397997:0xb0884dfebecc27df!8m2!3d28.4606402!4d77.4954575!16s%2Fg%2F11d_75xpnf!19sChIJl3k5M9zBDDkR3yfMvv5NiLA?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1\", \"AvgRating\": 4.0, \"Longitude\": 77.4954575, \"NameHindi\": \"ग्रेटर नोएडा कॉलेज\", \"Description\": \"\", \"WebsiteLink\": \"http://gnct.co.in/\", \"TotalReviews\": 105, \"BusinessHours\": {\"$id\": \"20\", \"$values\": []}}','2026-05-28 14:15:56',0,28.4606402,77.4954575,1),
