(1155,'google-cid:0x390ceb4eaaaaaaab:0x321412756718874c',28699,'Shiv Nadar Institution of Eminence Deemed to be University','शिव नाडर इंस्टीट्यूट ऑफ एमिनेंस डीम्ड-टू-बी-यूनिवर्सिटी','Noida, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201314','1800 102 1768','snu.edu','https://www.snu.edu.in/home','',4.40,509,'','https://www.google.com/maps/place/Shiv+Nadar+Institution+of+Eminence+Deemed+to+be+University/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390ceb4eaaaaaaab:0x321412756718874c!8m2!3d28.5267298!4d77.575363!16s%2Fm%2F0k8ylqf!19sChIJq6qqqk7rDDkRTIcYZ3USFDI?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1','[]','[{\"Key\": \"address\", \"Value\": [\"Address: Noida, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201314\"]}, {\"Key\": \"authority\", \"Value\": [\"Website: snu.edu.in\"]}, {\"Key\": \"phone:tel:18001021768\", \"Value\": [\"Phone: 1800 102 1768\"]}, {\"Key\": \"oloc\", \"Value\": [\"Plus code: GHGG+M4 Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh\"]}, {\"Key\": \"Accessibility\", \"Value\": [\"Has wheelchair-accessible car park\", \"Has wheelchair-accessible entrance\"]}, {\"Key\": \"Service options\", \"Value\": [\"On-site services available\"]}, {\"Key\": \"Parking\", \"Value\": [\"Free parking lot\"]}]','[{\"Hours\": [{\"Day\": \"Monday\", \"Time\": \"10 am–5 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Tuesday\", \"Time\": \"10 am–5 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Wednesday\", \"Time\": \"10 am–5 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Thursday\", \"Time\": \"10 am–5 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Friday\", \"Time\": \"10 am–5 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Saturday\", \"Time\": \"Closed\"}, {\"Day\": \"Sunday\", \"Time\": \"Closed\"}], \"Category\": \"More\"}]','{\"Reviews\": [{\"Date\": \"2026-03-28T08:50:12.1574605Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">When I first joined SNU, the indoor sports complex instantly became my favourite spot on campus. It’s spacious, modern, and always well maintained. I often come here for workouts or games with friends, and it helps me stay active alongside academics.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1UFlVRlhOVXBDTURkeFpWSlpaM2RJYVVWMU5GRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Vanshika Sharma\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-28T08:50:12.2607924Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Shiv Nadar Institute of Eminence is an outstanding place for students seeking quality education and a holistic learning experience. The university stands out for its remarkable faculty, who are not only experts in their respective fields …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-15\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNfNWJ6ZEp3EAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle260.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aWF4WUdFemR1VUF4VmNzS3dDSFNqcUtzd1EwcE1GQ0FVb0FRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNfNWJ6ZEp3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shlok Yadav\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-02-28T08:50:12.3527696Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">As a PhD student in Chemical Engineering at SNU, specializing in process systems and sustainable technologies, I’ve found the research environment both challenging and supportive. Working closely with faculty on meaningful projects has sharpened my analytical skills and confidence in solving real-world problems.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGTFNqaHRTbGt0TTBwUU0wSXpPVkp2WkVneGNVRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Mool Chand\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-28T08:50:12.437445Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Nicely built Infrastructure, good Teachers as well. How the University evolves as a Education Hub will be Imp. They do noT loose the vision of Academics in their everyday routine of University will be most critical. My son got admitted in BTech CSE. Hope they do well.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM3dDhPb0t3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sandeep Chauhan\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-01-28T08:50:12.5674645Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">For me, the best part of SNU is the Career Development Center. My career advisor guided me through resumes, interviews, and goals, and alumni interactions opened doors I didn’t expect. Truly growth-focused support.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkSmVXUmpRM3BuYmpadlZrdFJWWFI1TFZOS1lsRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"suraj pratap\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-02-28T08:50:12.6523131Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">SNU’s library feels like the heart of academic life! With its rare collections, research journals, and digital access, it’s been my go-to space for focused study. The peaceful atmosphere inspires long hours of meaningful reading and writing.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toSFpGOXNjVnBpYkY5WWFFcHNXRU54TUVZelpHYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sadhna Bhatt\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-02-28T08:50:12.7376729Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">As a fourth-semester MSc Economics student at SNU, I’ve gained strong quantitative skills, policy perspective, and research exposure through rigorous coursework and applied learning experiences. This prepares me confidently for higher studies and professional roles.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5NmFGaFBSMHByZW1kUFUzRkxNVk5pZDNwWVMyYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"SONU KUMAR\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-01-28T08:50:12.8328289Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Joining the BA Research in Sociology at SNU was a great decision. The faculty encouraged me from day one to build my own research questions, attend seminars, and conferences, which expanded my way of thinking.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25aZmFYUjZUWFozTWpkYVVFcHVUbGhQUTFkcWNHYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sunil Kumar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-12-28T08:50:12.9347528Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Being a student of Bachelor\'s in Design program at SNU has been truly inspiring. The creative studios, supportive faculty, and interdisciplinary approach make learning both practical as well as exciting.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2treFNuazRXa3BuVUVscmVFaHBkRWhFYnkxZlVHYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Yamini Verma\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-01-28T08:50:13.0522662Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I love how SNU encourages every student’s passion. Joining CineU helped me explore filmmaking through screenings, discussions, and festivals. It’s amazing to learn, collaborate, and grow beyond academics in such a supportive community.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WWGFFbFhVMmxxZVVaWk0zSmpRblpRYVZBdFQyYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sonendar\"}], \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}','[{\"LargeUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAEZWTGxhL2iUn6GAhs24SxS6Mt8iVUljlu2ZtsTiShpvKai-bhWbVRCNmknKfR1y0RJdHpAQeL0M6AAZac7-atg0op4tYf713gL2P5srT23Y3ja2Wqezl_dDx7oOAc4TU7kfKHI=s435-k-no\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAEZWTGxhL2iUn6GAhs24SxS6Mt8iVUljlu2ZtsTiShpvKai-bhWbVRCNmknKfR1y0RJdHpAQeL0M6AAZac7-atg0op4tYf713gL2P5srT23Y3ja2Wqezl_dDx7oOAc4TU7kfKHI=w203-h135-k-no\"}, {\"LargeUrl\": \"\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAFmXD5fRDJvVjbLMtJM3M7ckdo0NrOYUNk5P0PiY_zKm7eeQM0gOLpzHlAe-ZWTBuC6uMTzNTpcEzdi048yEbSg-CBWVScr9k4BvXJIPfOnaYC4aQtxRuFJ8GbAiwwkmvvMGt2A=w203-h114-k-no\"}, {\"LargeUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAFP5kzfrJ7NOWTsOElCmaO8HzzAsuc_HtsZASDx4YOQp3jDH9Rh1mQggQQ2ijEqEmfa5RGj6VEXyxlBYC0-lIsXdzfGGmoIqfVJbZKawg-95dPcZW8zP9mGvYVtPZE3AXMBgvd39w=s391-k-no\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAFP5kzfrJ7NOWTsOElCmaO8HzzAsuc_HtsZASDx4YOQp3jDH9Rh1mQggQQ2ijEqEmfa5RGj6VEXyxlBYC0-lIsXdzfGGmoIqfVJbZKawg-95dPcZW8zP9mGvYVtPZE3AXMBgvd39w=w203-h150-k-no\"}, {\"LargeUrl\": \"\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAEYwABI2jejYbqc6yscI131MtiOYIe_3pw3_PITrtGypONDxTQn32Ie8Et2QShEtZU