28T08:52:21.0891013Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Its one of the Fraud university kind, Before paying the admission fees they says teacher are supportive they will support , but then they only give marks to there’s favourite students. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-85\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5NFowcEpkR2N3ZERoRlpuWnRkRTFLVUY5MVUyYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1072.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXYwNm5BemR1VUF4VTh1YXdDSFdnRENpc1EwcE1GQ0Rzb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5NFowcEpkR2N3ZERoRlpuWnRkRTFLVUY5MVUyYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Failure and Hope\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-02-28T08:52:21.1427088Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Worst experience after passout from college.. no on response properly.. I applied for my llm degree before 1 year and after that I visited college 2 times they said you will get message and I don\'t get any message from college for my …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-86\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSNFYxSlZTMlUxT0dORVNHVkpUaTFrUzI1a00zYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1073.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXYwNm5BemR1VUF4VTh1YXdDSFdnRENpc1EwcE1GQ0Q0b0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 2, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSNFYxSlZTMlUxT0dORVNHVkpUaTFrUzI1a00zYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Divya Chaudhary\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-10-28T08:52:21.1977686Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The university has a really good infrastructure — clean campus, modern classrooms, well-equipped labs, and an overall great environment for studying. The faculty is also quite supportive and focuses on helping students understand concepts …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-87\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210WmVVdGxRMGRXV2t0a00wZFRUekl4WjIwNGMyYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1074.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXYwNm5BemR1VUF4VTh1YXdDSFdnRENpc1EwcE1GQ0VFb0JRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 3, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210WmVVdGxRMGRXV2t0a00wZFRUekl4WjIwNGMyYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"harshit\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-10-28T08:52:23.2925519Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">First of all, the college campus and facilities are quite good. The infrastructure, cleanliness, and environment are all fine. However, as the saying goes, “The world isn’t bad, people make it bad.” That’s exactly what happens here — the …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-88\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GNU1rUTJNMnRvUzBsbWVGWlVUWEJ6VlU5MVJFRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1075.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXYwNm5BemR1VUF4VTh1YXdDSFdnRENpc1EwcE1GQ0VRb0JnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GNU1rUTJNMnRvUzBsbWVGWlVUWEJ6VlU5MVJFRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"ujjwal clips\"}, {\"Date\": \"2021-05-28T08:52:23.3435837Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Nature friendly campus,the ambience extraordinary...\\n\\nGood for extracurricular activities. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-89\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR5b09ydFpBEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1076.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXYwNm5BemR1VUF4VTh1YXdDSFdnRENpc1EwcE1GQ0Vjb0J3Il0=\\\">More</butt