pportive they will support , but then they only give marks to there’s favourite students. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-85\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5NFowcEpkR2N3ZERoRlpuWnRkRTFLVUY5MVUyYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1072.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXYwNm5BemR1VUF4VTh1YXdDSFdnRENpc1EwcE1GQ0Rzb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5NFowcEpkR2N3ZERoRlpuWnRkRTFLVUY5MVUyYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Failure and Hope\"}, {\"$id\": \"34\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T08:52:21.1427088Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Worst experience after passout from college.. no on response properly.. I applied for my llm degree before 1 year and after that I visited college 2 times they said you will get message and I don\'t get any message from college for my …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-86\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSNFYxSlZTMlUxT0dORVNHVkpUaTFrUzI1a00zYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1073.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXYwNm5BemR1VUF4VTh1YXdDSFdnRENpc1EwcE1GQ0Q0b0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 2, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSNFYxSlZTMlUxT0dORVNHVkpUaTFrUzI1a00zYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Divya Chaudhary\"}, {\"$id\": \"35\", \"Date\": \"2025-10-28T08:52:21.1977686Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The university has a really good infrastructure — clean campus, modern classrooms, well-equipped labs, and an overall great environment for studying. The faculty is also quite supportive and focuses on helping students understand concepts …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-87\\\" a