iewer\": \"cHatTanZ vK\"}, {\"$id\": \"38\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-28T08:52:23.3952496Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Good college...But department of examination is too much slow.\\nIf you want the marksheet, they just ignore and tell to wait for the days.\\nIt is 1 year, no degree no result...</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 3, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNZNE5PcUV3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Himanshu Upraity\"}, {\"$id\": \"39\", \"Date\": \"2022-05-28T08:52:25.4701828Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">If you want to learn animation or vfx... better use youtube (if you value free knowledge)... or if you wanna pay, pay for online courses which costs a fraction of university fees... …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-91\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURJb2EyLW5BRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1078.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aXYwNm5BemR1VUF4VTh1YXdDSFdnRENpc1EwcE1GQ0dVb0NRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURJb2EyLW5BRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Nitin Sharma\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"3\", \"Url\": \"https://www.instagram.com/muitindia/\", \"Name\": \"Open booking link\"}]}, \"Address\": \"No 04, MAHARISHI UNIVERSITY OF INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY, Entry Gate, Maharishi Ashram Chowk, opp. Sec 110, near Maharishi Nagar Post Office, Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201304\", \"Website\": \"muitnoida.edu\", \"Latitude\": 28.5343764, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Maharishi+University+of+Information+Technology+Noida+Campus/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390ce8ba85555525:0x7bb4aa0809ceeddd!8m2!3d28.5343764!4d77.3828162!16s%2Fg%2F11cn0t8fzd!19sChIJJVVVhbroDDkR3e3OCQiqtHs?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1\", \"AvgRating\": 4.0, \"Longitude\": 77.3828162, \"NameHi