 <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-173\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUNTZHYnB3RRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1909.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ak41SXZFMU51VUF4V0d0NndDSFVIckNaVVEwcE1GQ0FJb0FBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUNTZHYnB3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Daisy Singh\"}, {\"$id\": \"35\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-28T09:23:45.9159778Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The teachers are supportive and really know their subjects. The campus is well-kept, and the computer labs are well-equipped and always working properly, which makes coding practice smooth. There are also regular workshops, events, and …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-174\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VLanA3STJYN2VqcFlnEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1910.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ak41SXZFMU51VUF4V0d0NndDSFVIckNaVVEwcE1GQ0Frb0FRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VLanA3STJYN2VqcFlnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pari Katariya\"}, {\"$id\": \"36\", \"Date\": \"2020-05-28T09:23:46.0004305Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Teaching Staff of MBA department is Best Ritesh Trivedi Sir, Divyanshu Mam, Rinky Mam, MBA Director Dr. Shakti Prakash sir are the best teachers, facilities are also good in MBA department. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-175\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURja0lybFRnEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1911.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ak41SXZFMU51VUF4V0d0NndDSFVIckNaVVEwcE1GQ0F3b0FnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURja0lybFRnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Naveen Kaushik\"}, {\"$id\": \"37\", \"Date\": \"2025-07-28T09:23:46.0509651Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I\'m a student at Lloyd. I had a positive and enriching experience. The college has provided me a strong academic environment with a good balance between theory and practical exposure. I feel more confident for the real world now. The …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-176\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKNVRVUk5XRVI0YWtONFJXaFhSazloVldGNWRXYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1912.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ak41SXZFMU51VUF4V0d0NndDSFVIckNaVVEwcE1GQ0Nrb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKNVRVUk5XRVI0YWtONFJXaFhSazloVldGNWRXYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Raj Kumar\"}, {\"$id\": \"38\", \"Date\": \"2018-05-28T09:23:46.1364749Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Skyline Institute of Engineering is one of the leading Engineering Colleges in India. It is rated as best engineering college in Noida, Delhi NCR, greater Noida and UP. You are not only entitled for top education but also are assured of …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-177\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURnZzhEV1V3EAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1913.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ak41SXZFMU51VUF4V0d0NndDSFVIckNaVVEwcE1GQ0N3b0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURnZzhEV1V3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Vivek Kumar\"}, {\"$id\": \"39\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-28T09:23:46.1864304Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">- *Infrastructure:* The campus is beautiful and well-maintained, with well-equipped labs and classrooms. The library and sports facilities are also commendable. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-178\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJLUF5b0xYLWJ1NVh3EAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1914.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ak41SXZFMU51VUF4V0d0NndDSFVIckNaVVEwcE1GQ0RVb0JRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJLUF5b0xYLWJ1NVh3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sonali Sinha\"}, {\"$id\": \"40\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-28T09:23:46.2447111Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I’m from the 2026 batch, and overall, my experience at the college has been good. The college provides solid support not just in academics, but also in other activities like events and workshops. The faculty is helpful and encourages us to …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-179\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VMcVlxY18xOGNMaU5BEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1915.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ak41SXZFMU51VUF4V0d0NndDSFVIckNaVVEwcE1GQ0Rnb0JnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VMcVlxY18xOGNMaU5BEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sajal Jha\"}, {\"$id\": \"41\", \"Date\": \"2023-05-28T09:23:46.3408447Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The college was awesome place to have fun and this is the college for bachelors and masters program for engineering student, law student and management student.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN1bXN6b2RREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Subhan Khan\"}, {\"$id\": \"42\", \"Date\": \"2019-05-28T09:23:46.3911649Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Good looking from outside but not good management inside the building.\\nOff course it is one of the biggest college with playground.\\nIf management and network will correct then it will be best.\\nNew branch of pharmacy and BCA are opened last year.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURvMkxXRG5RRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Aashutosh Kumar\"}, {\"$id\": \"43\", \"Date\": \"2022-05-28T09:23:46.4395857Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Lloyd Institute of Engineering and Technology (LIET) is a Top Premier Engineering institution offering B. Tech Courses with a vision of Building Futuristic Careers by Experiential Learning. LIET is spread across 13 acres of lush green campus.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURxdXM3amxBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Mohit shukla\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"Plot No. 3, Knowledge Park II, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201310\", \"Website\": \"liet.in\", \"Latitude\": 28.4572102, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Lloyd+Institute+of+Engineering+%26+Technology/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390cc117b9edb9ef:0xdab6d36968d2fd8b!8m2!3d28.4572102!4d77.4929512!16s%2Fg%2F11nncwjyjm!19sChIJ77ntuRfBDDkRi_3SaGnTtto?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1\", \"AvgRating\": 4.2, \"Longitude\": 77.4929512, \"NameHindi\": \"लॉयड इंस्टीट्यूट ऑफ़ इंजीनियरिंग & टेक्नोलॉजी\", \"Description\": \"\", \"WebsiteLink\": \"https://liet.in/\", \"TotalReviews\": 826, \"BusinessHours\": {\"$id\": \"22\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"23\", \"Hours\": {\"$id\": \"24\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"25\", \"Day\": \"Monday\", \"Time\": \"6 am–9 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"26\", \"Day\": \"Tuesday\", \"Time\": \"6 am–9 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"27\", \"Day\": \"Wednesday\", \"Time\": \"6 am–9 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"28\", \"Day\": \"Thursday\", \"Time\": \"6 am–9 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"29\", \"Day\": \"Friday\", \"Time\": \"6 am–9 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"30\", \"Day\": \"Saturday\", \"Time\": \"6 am–9 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"31\", \"Day\": \"Sunday\", \"Time\"