 was really helpful. Very good behaviour.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKODlYNEd3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"P kumar\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"1st Floor, Shop No - 10, Galleria Market, 1, Crossings Republik, Ghaziabad, Uttar Pradesh 201016\", \"Website\": \"\", \"Latitude\": 28.6261586, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Infotech+Solutions/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390cee3744cf58c7:0x31142b8e8066c77c!8m2!3d28.6261586!4d77.4349661!16s%2Fg%2F11b7ln6f9p!19sChIJx1jPRDfuDDkRfMdmgI4rFDE?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1\", \"AvgRating\": 3.5, \"Longitude\": 77.4349661, \"NameHindi\": \"इन्फोटेक समाधान\", \"Description\": \"\", \"WebsiteLink\": \"\", \"TotalReviews\": 59, \"BusinessHours\": {\"$id\": \"20\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"21\", \"Hours\": {\"$id\": \"22\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"23\", \"Day\": \"Monday\", \"Time\": \"10:30 am–8:30 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"24\", \"Day\": \"Tuesday\", \"Time\": \"10:30 am–8:30 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"25\", \"Day\": \"Wednesday\", \"Time\": \"10:30 am–8:30 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"26\", \"Day\": \"Thursday\", \"Time\": \"10:30 am–8:30 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"27\", \"Day\": \"Friday\", \"Time\": \"10:30 am–8:30 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"28\", \"Day\": \"Saturday\", \"Time\": \"10:30 am–8:30 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"29\", \"Day\": \"Sunday\", \"Time\": \"10:30 am–8:30 pm\"}]}, \"Category\": \"More\"}]}}','2026-05-28 15:15:41',0,28.6261586,77.4349661,1),
