T04:42:52.4250883Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Hello everyone,\\n\\nI am thrilled to stand before you today to share my experience as an IELTS …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-51\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNQNkxlcGFnEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle546.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aTN4SkRPMTkyVUF4VWV1cXdDSFNPOEJZb1EwcE1GQ0Fzb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNQNkxlcGFnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Anaisha Chabria\"}, {\"$id\": \"40\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-29T04:42:52.494364Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I joined Jaivik Overseas for IELTS coaching, and it was one of the best decisions I made. The trainers were professional and gave personalized attention to each student. With their tips and strategies, I managed to score an 8 band on my first attempt. Highly recommend their services!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNQdk9mLXpnRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shinu Shinu\"}, {\"$id\": \"41\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-29T04:42:52.5425255Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Jaivik Overseas Consultants (JOC) is a study abroad consultancy based in Ghaziabad, India, dedicated to assisting students in pursuing higher education overseas. Their services encompass university admissions, scholarship guidance, visa assistance, and education loan support.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUN3eWZLeVNREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Devansh Bhardwaj\"}, {\"$id\": \"42\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-29T04:42:52.5937132Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I had a fantastic experience with jaivik overseas consultants I enrolled for IELTS preparation and achieved 7.0 bands overall the study material they used and practice test helps me to achieveing my desired score. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-54\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNQdlAyTjZRRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle549.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aTN4SkRPMTkyVUF4VWV1cXdDSFNPOEJZb1EwcE1GQ0JRb0JnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNQdlAyTjZRRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Rohit Sarama\"}, {\"$id\": \"43\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-29T04:42:52.6569711Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Jaivik Overseas is definitely one of the top study abroad consultants in Noida and study abroad consultants in Ghaziabad. I visited their office for guidance to study in Canada and UK. They explained the student visa processing for UK &amp; …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-55\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNBdnZHSUJBEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle550.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aTN4SkRPMTkyVUF4VWV1cXdDSFNPOEJZb1EwcE1GQ0Jjb0J3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNBdnZHSUJBEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Disha Chauhan\"}, {\"$id\": \"44\", \"Date\": \"2025-10-29T04:42:52.7153522Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It was an amazing experience, they helped me a lot with my IELTS preparation, I was much confident and composed during my exams.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taQ1kwdEZaVjluVWpKMmJuSkJhamxGYUVaQmFIYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sania patil\"}, {\"$id\": \"45\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-29T04:42:52.7993579Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It was a very great experience with Jaivik Overseas Consultants. I was very confused about my career and all, but when I joined JOC, I got a very clear vision about it. The team members are open-hearted and helpful. Thank you so much for your help and support, Jaivik Overseas Consultants.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNfcnV5ZmFREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Nipun Suananiya\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"Orbit plaza, 333, Crossings Republik, Ghaziabad, Uttar Pradesh 201016\", \"Website\": \"jaivikoverseasconsultants.com\", \"Latitude\": 28.6308054, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Jaivik+Overseas+Consultants+%E2%80%93+Best+IELTS,+PTE+%26+Study+Abroad+Consultancy+in+Ghaziabad/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390cefc332b1bbb1:0x31659a44a3ece626!8m2!3d28.6308054!4d77.4353605!16s%2Fg%2F11w8bwsvlt!19sChIJsbuxMsPvDDkRJubso0SaZTE?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1\", \"AvgRating\": 5.0, \"Longitude\": 77.4353605, \"NameHindi\": \"जैविक ओवरसीज कंसल्टेंट्स - बेस्ट इल्ट्स, पते & स्टडी अब्रॉड कंसलटेंसी इन गाजियाबाद\", \"Description\": \"\", \"WebsiteLink\": \"https://jaivikoverseasconsultants.com/\", \"TotalReviews\": 22, \"BusinessHours\": {\"$id\": \"24\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"25\", \"Hours\": {\"$id\": \"26\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"27\", \"Day\": \"Monday\", \"Time\": \"9:30 am–7 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"28\", \"Day\": \"Tuesday\", \"Time\": \"9:30 am–7 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"29\", \"Day\": \"Wednesday\", \"Time\": \"9:30 am–7 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"30\", \"Day\": \"Thursday\", \"Time\": \"9:30 am–7 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"31\", \"Day\": \"Friday\", \"Time\": \"9:30 am–7 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"32\", \"Day\": \"Saturday\", \"Time\": \"9:30 am–7 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"33\", \"Day\": \"Sunday\", \"Time\": \"Closed\"}]}, \"Category\": \"More\"}]}}','2026-05-29 10:13:14',0,28.6308054,77.4353605,1),
