orate Communication course at Engear, and it was a very valuable learning experience. The course content was practical, well structured, and directly applicable to real workplace communication. A special thanks …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-123\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tZdFptSlpVMnBVWWpZeVFrTTBkVzVmTTI1eExXYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1169.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aWV1OGUtMk4yVUF4WEZ1cXdDSFlzUEFqOFEwcE1GQ0FVb0FRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tZdFptSlpVMnBVWWpZeVFrTTBkVzVmTTI1eExXYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Anu Shya\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-01-29T04:46:47.2249105Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Engear communication sessions were very helpful. I liked the way my trainer explained the concept; it was very clear. Thanks to Sinchana Mam, she encouraged me to speak without fear, which made a big difference. I can see the improvement in …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-124\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SWFZHcEhSMlJuZDBVNU5qZHNNM3A2VTA1SE5rRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1170.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aWV1OGUtMk4yVUF4WEZ1cXdDSFlzUEFqOFEwcE1GQ0Fnb0FnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SWFZHcEhSMlJuZDBVNU5qZHNNM3A2VTA1SE5rRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Manjushree R\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-12-29T04:46:47.2770861Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I joined Engear Classes, and Sumbul Madam explained every topic very clearly. She gives regular assignments and personally interacts with students, which really helps in understanding the concepts. It was a great learning experience, and my nervousness has reduced a lot. Highly recommended!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214emMycG9VemR2ZUZaYVpFRjRSRmx0Um5GNlYwRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"K. sai kamal\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-29T04:46:47.352498Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Engear classes were  very helpful. I learned new vocabulary, improved my pronunciation, and gained confidence in speaking. The trainer was supportive and explained everything in an easy way. I really enjoyed the sessions</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pac01FdE5VVGd6U1VKNlQyUnVVSE5QYWpKU1VGRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Suraj Khot\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-29T04:46:47.3993626Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">\'I have had an outstanding experience with Engear Education! The courses are well-structured and incredibly engaging, making complex topics easy to understand. The instructors are not only knowledgeable but also genuinely passionate about …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-127\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGR2FsRmtUelV5UkVoQlV6TllNelpVZDI1bldHYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1173.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aWV1OGUtMk4yVUF4WEZ1cXdDSFlzUEFqOFEwcE1GQ0JFb0JRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGR2FsRmtUelV5UkVoQlV6TllNelpVZDI1bldHYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sameer pawar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-10-29T04:46:47.4472403Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Great learning. First of all thanks to Sinchana mam and Engear team. Who gave me confidence to speak in public as well in my daily routine. I have done a 3 month course. Engear helped me a lot to improve my communication skills and I feel a lot more confident now while communicating in English.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWdGFrSndSbmRvTWtOb2JsbzVla2RTY0Y5eVMwRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Dheeraj Verma\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-29T04:46:47.5222501Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Learning English has been a great experience. It improved my communication skills, boosted my confidence, and helped me express my ideas more clearly. I feel more comfortable interacting with people in both personal and professional settings.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21obFluSm9helIzWVVKbGRUVnZaMWxWTTJ0SUxYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Nikhil Kumar H.N\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-10-29T04:46:47.5747593Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It was an amazing experience learning with the team. Joining the program really helped me feel more confident in my communication and public speaking skills. The materials were super useful for keeping track of my progress and fixing any …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-130\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWYWVUSXhaM0k1TmxndFozVnVOVUpuU0hOS2QyYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1176.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aWV1OGUtMk4yVUF4WEZ1cXdDSFlzUEFqOFEwcE1GQ0Jvb0NBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWYWVUSXhaM0k1TmxndFozVnVOVUpuU0hOS2QyYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Priyanshu Chauhan\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-29T04:46:47.6212156Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">My sessions with Engear was great. Sinchana ma\'am is highly skilled and knows the job well.\\nI joined for written communication skills. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-131\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKelkxVnNXRkZsTUhGclozaElhMlpZVDJ4M2VYYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1177.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aWV1OGUtMk