2026-05-29T04:52:52.3692861Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Excellent Work. I got my website made by Deep Rahul. He did a fabulous job in creating it and its maintenance. He has been also very diligent in his SEO work for the same and has worked very conscientiously to build my online presence. I highly appreciate his work and recommend him strongly.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205ek5HMUtlRzVHVFc0NVluQlpXRmh3U1U5dlRuYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sahil Arora\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-29T04:52:52.4517576Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I appreciated Deep Rahul’s clear communication and transparency regarding SEO work and processes. He also offers helpful suggestions to save money by avoiding unnecessary expenses.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsSWNqaE1RVFZZV21wa01FeHBZa00yUlRJeFQxRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Rahul Kumar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-29T04:52:52.4981365Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Deep Rahul has a good knowledge of SEO. I recommend him, if anyone looking for SEO service in Ghaziabad.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxWU5FVmhaSGw1ZEVwRmJWaHBkVFJ5Y204MlEzYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"vipin kumar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-29T04:52:52.5443001Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I was looking for an SEO expert in Meerut for my website. One of my friends recommended Deep Rahul for SEO and truly he is very good at SEO. I run a sports business in Meerut. I am getting very good sales through our website.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tJNVJISnVOa3BCUm0xVlkyUXhSM0p3VTBwd1VrRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sachin Kumar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-29T04:52:52.5911752Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Deep is true professional.He takes care of every detail while constructing the website.I would really recommend him if someone is looking to launch any professional website.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWemFXOWxkVnBpZUhNNFRVbDNTRk0yUm5KbkxVRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Dr Neha Kakkar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-29T04:52:52.6806391Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">We did SEO for our clinic with Deep Rahul. The result is very good. Our website ranking on Google has improved and traffic also increased nicely. We are also getting good number of patients from Google now. Overall happy with his work and support.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkRmQzbFRWbmhJTUZGZlFWODNOVTVqVVcwdGEzYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"ajit singh rana\"}], \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}','[{\"LargeUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/p/AF1QipNeERrC7SlczjaLRkp0xAxRHyLH_oNTTbcJNu_x=s522-k-no\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/p/AF1QipNeERrC7SlczjaLRkp0xAxRHyLH_oNTTbcJNu_x=w203-h112-k-no\"}, {\"LargeUrl\": \"https://streetviewpixels-pa.googleapis.com/v1/thumbnail?output=thumbnail&cb_client=maps_sv.tactile.gps&panoid=VUddgvNQtIpHjwTehdG6Kg&w=588&h=290&thumb=2&yaw=190.76854&pitch=0\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://streetviewpixels-pa.googleapis.com/v1/thumbnail?panoid=VUddgvNQtIpHjwTehdG6Kg&cb_client=maps_sv.tactile.gps&w=203&h=100&yaw=190.76854&pitch=0&thumbfov=100\"}, {\"LargeUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/p/AF1QipMrm3Qv0NA8HXSjaftKOu3xysAi1-58p_4jiGCC=s508-k-no\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/p/AF1QipMrm3Qv0NA8HXSjaftKOu3xysAi1-58p_4jiGCC=w203-h203-k-no\"}]','[]','{\"$id\": \"1\", \"Cid\": \"google-cid:0x390cef7aa81c5a37:0xcdbfcf647b0a510c\", \"Menu\": {\"$id\": \"48\", \"$values\": []}, \"Name\": \"Deep Rahul - Freelance SEO Consultant\", \"About\": {\"$id\": \"3\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"4\", \"Key\": \"address\", \"Value\": {\"$id\": \"5\", \"$values\": [\"Address: Supertech Livingston, A1-1101, Crossings Republik, Ghaziabad, Uttar Pradesh 201016\"]}}, {\"$id\": \"6\", \"Key\": \"authority\", \"Value\"