 well. Their professional knowledge helped us attain the most comfortable and contemporary  Office in Delhi NCR region.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNRcDVteS1nRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Anuradha Kasana\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-05-29T06:39:12.7146042Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">A beautiful stand alone building in a peaceful sector of Noida .. easy parking and access .</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNEMHJyX2NREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Rashmi Prasad\"}, {\"Date\": \"2019-05-29T06:39:12.7683755Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Awesome staff, friendly behaviour, delivers outstanding infrastructure and a lot...!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURBbVpXeG1RRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Ayush Joshi\"}, {\"Date\": \"2017-05-29T06:39:12.8144112Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Best working environment. Always up for new ideas!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNBNXRqeG1BRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Vandita Chhibber\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-05-29T06:39:12.895878Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Great Art &amp; technology available with solutions.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM1b1BMUTBBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Santosh Patil\"}, {\"Date\": \"2017-05-29T06:39:12.9480966Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The best architecture firm i have worked for.(and i hve worked for quite a few)</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURneWZYTHdRRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pratibha Rawat\"}, {\"Date\": \"2018-05-29T06:39:13.0012063Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Friendly staff, nice infrastructure with all facilities.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURRaHFqMVhBEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shubhank Jindal\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-05-29T06:39:13.0751496Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"