kYxN1RWaGQ2VUF4VWV1NndDSFdkN0VOSVEwcE1GQ0Fzb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNoemEycHZnRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"mkd Tiles\"}, {\"$id\": \"36\", \"Date\": \"2024-05-29T08:09:01.3340942Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Recently I availed the DTDC courier services. Though they directly dont deal with major item courier services but in my case they tied up with a trusted partner to deliver my scooty from Noida to Bihar. Glad to say that they were very …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-24\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUM092bTZRRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle187.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3akYxN1RWaGQ2VUF4VWV1NndDSFdkN0VOSVEwcE1GQ0E0b0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUM092bTZRRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Ashis Ranjan\"}, {\"$id\": \"37\", \"Date\": \"2025-09-29T08:09:01.4022626Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Very good service</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210RVkxUlJSQzFXTVdoTlgzWkJMVTlRYkdSaE5tYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"bhupendra singh\"}, {\"$id\": \"38\", \"Date\": \"2024-05-29T08:09:03.4958151Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">DTDC Courier service falls short of expectations, here. One major drawback is their consistent practice of overcharging customers. This blatant exploitation leaves a sour taste and raises concerns about their ethics. Moreover, their …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-26\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKcmZ5RHB3RRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle189.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3akYxN1RWaGQ2VUF4VWV1NndDSFdkN0VOSVEwcE1GQ0JRb0JnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKcmZ5RHB3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Mukesh\"}, {\"$id\": \"39\", \"Date\": \"2025-06-29T08:09:03.5620473Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Professional service. On time delivery. Booked a home pick up and drop. Got on time delivery.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJYk9uZXlNOHRUejN3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"SHASHANK JHA\"}, {\"$id\": \"40\", \"Date\": \"2024-05-29T08:09:03.6327899Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Really very polite and punctual. They suggest best option for the delivery. They pick up and deliver on time. I am fully satisfied with there service.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR4d01DVlVnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Nalini Raj Mausam\"}, {\"$id\": \"41\", \"Date\": \"2024-05-29T08:09:03.6824015Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Great Service very polite. They will explain everything to you in brief. Overall a very positive experience</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR4eUl5cUdREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Karan Sharma\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"G.F, Nambardar Plaza, Shop No.28, near Yatharth Hospital, Sector 1, Bisrakh Jalalpur, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201318\", \"Website\": \"\", \"Latitude\": 28.5753448, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/DTDC+International+%26+Domestic-Courier+services+in+Greater+Noida/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390cef80d7c47bdb:0xb18d824a4bb38382!8m2!3d28.5753448!4d77.4447512!16s%2Fg%2F11s56plsgc!19sChIJ23vE14DvDDkRgoOzS0qCjbE?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1\", \"AvgRating\": 4.5, \"Longitude\": 77.4447512, \"NameHindi\": \"डीटीडीसी इंटरनेशनल & डोमेस्टिक-कोरियर सर्विसेज इन ग्रेटर नोएडा\", \"Description\": \"\", \"WebsiteLink\": \"\", \"TotalReviews\": 149, \"BusinessHours\": {\"$id\": \"20\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"21\"