1Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Received parcel in indore in just 2 days. Great service.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOdlZHcHRUM1k1ZVVWVk5tTnVOVXR6YTA5T1NHYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Agastya Shrivastava\"}, {\"$id\": \"35\", \"Date\": \"2024-05-29T08:51:45.6875921Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Pathetic service. Don\'t ever send an any courier from them especially an international one. They can\'t handle documents. They misplaced my documents. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-17\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwdHVETUtREAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle150.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3am81cGljajk2VUF4WEZ1cXdDSFlzUEFqOFEwcE1GQ0JVb0JRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwdHVETUtREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Tulip Agarwal\"}, {\"$id\": \"36\", \"Date\": \"2025-10-29T08:51:45.7559083Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It was good experience. Best service.with normal rates.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pWamVWSnlSamhHT1RCcVgybExUbWxOVFVWbE9VRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Jyotsna Srivastava\"}, {\"$id\": \"37\", \"Date\": \"2025-10-29T08:51:45.8143625Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Superb service, prompt response.\\nSurely recommended!!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xselRWaHROSE16TnkxR01ERjNjVEJNYWtOdFptYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"sushant andhale\"}, {\"$id\": \"38\", \"Date\": \"2024-05-29T08:51:47.905304Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">These guys are fraud. It is not real DTDC. Very rude behaviour. They overcharged by three times and refused to give receipt.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNaeGRtXy1RRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Gaurav\"}, {\