re clearly, which really puts you at ease. The clinic is clean and hygienic, well-organized, and the staff is very …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-28\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGVFZqZDBNelJ5VkMxNmVYUXpUbG95YjBZMWFFRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle505.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3amgxT3Jab042VUF4WG9WSjBKSFJfSkZqMFEwcE1GQ0FJb0FBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGVFZqZDBNelJ5VkMxNmVYUXpUbG95YjBZMWFFRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"OMs CAVE\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-29T10:09:51.9842005Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Very nice dental clinic run by Dr. Rajtat and Sakshi in Sector 92, Noida. Went for dental problem (caping and dental implant). Very impressed by Dr. Rajat\'s professional approach. On my first visit after thorough examination he suggested …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-29\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCeldYaGhSRTA1Vlc5WFUybHdlRmxyUnpCbGVsRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle506.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3amgxT3Jab042VUF4WG9WSjBKSFJfSkZqMFEwcE1GQ0Frb0FRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCeldYaGhSRTA1Vlc5WFUybHdlRmxyUnpCbGVsRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"P.S. Bhandari\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-01-29T10:09:52.0375782Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Dr Rajat is one of the best and most genuine dentist we ever met. He explains every little thing before proceeding with treatment. We are highly satisfied and would recommend him to everyone who wish to consult a dentist.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWWmExQk5ablZwYmpCSmRtdEpWV1JHYUdwNFRYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"murari lal Srivastava\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-01-29T10:09:52.1104771Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Highly recommend Dr.Rajat\\nDr. Rajat provided an excellent experience. After having had a previous experience that was not ideal, I was reluctant to find a new dentist that I could trust. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-31\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KWGJEUnZRVkpLUjA5blNsVk5la3BQZDNaSldYYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle508.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3amgxT3Jab042VUF4WG9WSjBKSFJfSkZqMFEwcE1GQ0JNb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KWGJEUnZRVkpLUjA5blNsVk5la3BQZDNaSldYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Akshay Chauhan\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-12-29T10:09:52.160635Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Highly recommend! I had LOTS of anxiety about going to the dentist. After this visit, regarding my mom’s implant , I’m extremely satisfied.Dr. Rajat and Dr Sakshi were amazing. They made me and my mom feel comfortable and I believe the treatment plan is actionable and has my best interest in mind.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kTVZFSjFNRkEzVXpGelJVZERWVkpOY0hWYVVsRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Namisha Gulesh Mahato\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-12-29T10:09:52.2294987Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I had a great experience with Dr. Rajat and the team at Fennel Dental care. I was a little nervous about getting a dental implant, but the doctor explained the entire procedure in detail and used modern technology to make it a smooth and painless process. My new implant is strong and looks just like my other teeth.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0YVRVaHpaWFJDTkY5VGN6TnNUM2g1TTNKRVdYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pranav Modi\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-29T10:09:52.277484Z\", \"T