and decided to visit the Dental Trusted Clinic. My experience there was exceptional from start to finish.\\nThe clinic\'s atmosphere was welcoming, and the staff were both friendly and …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-125\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUdGRqaGJREAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2054.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUt3S0Rsb2Q2VUF4V3NmcDBKSFhXZUFDOFEwcE1GQ0FVb0FRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUdGRqaGJREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shrinka Anand\"}, {\"$id\": \"36\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-29T10:14:44.2306355Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Hi Went to Dr.Taruna for Implants.\\nI had 3 missing Teeth and was worried about the treatment.\\nBut after treatment at Trusted Dental I feel I was thinking too much about the …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-126\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VLblA4Y3ZCNTVpMXZBRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2055.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUt3S0Rsb2Q2VUF4V3NmcDBKSFhXZUFDOFEwcE1GQ0Fnb0FnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VLblA4Y3ZCNTVpMXZBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Satya Malik\"}, {\"$id\": \"37\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-29T10:14:44.3241659Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">In the gentle hands of Dr. Taruna, my elderly mother experienced a painless dental procedure. Her expertise and compassionate approach made all the difference. We are deeply grateful for her care and professionalism. Thank you, Dr. Taruna, …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-127\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJdUNub1NFOFozeGJnEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2056.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUt3S0Rsb2Q2VUF4V3NmcDBKSFhXZUFDOFEwcE1GQ0Fzb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJdUNub1NFOFozeGJnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Nandi Sevak\"}, {\"$id\": \"38\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T10:14:44.3741909Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Got rct done , it was painless, nice n polite staff, i wud recommend this doc? …</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kNUxWaEZVblJWVldwRUxYRmlYemg1Y0MxWGNYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Dr Javed\"}, {\"$id\": \"39\", \"Date\": \"2023-05-29T10:14:44.4233332Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">My first visit to Dr. Taruna was a great experience. She can immediately puts you at ease with her calm and sweet nature. The place was so relaxing and peaceful. She helped me to fix my teeth pain and prescribed some really good medicines. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-129\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4N1oydGxBRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2058.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUt3S0Rsb2Q2VUF4V3NmcDBKSFhXZUFDOFEwcE1GQ0JFb0JRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4N1oydGxBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Nimisha Singh\"}, {\"$id\": \"40\", \"Date\": \"2024-05-29T10:14:44.5140417Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Dr. Taruna was a thorough professional and helped me be at ease throughout the dental filling procedure. She answered my queries satisfactorily and provided me with appropriate guidance for proper maintenance of my teeth. I was very happy with the outcome of my dental fillings and would definitely recommend her.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNKMDQzNDBRRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Avneesh Kumar\"}, {\"$id\": \"41\", \"Date\": \"2024-05-29T10:14:44.5635777Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Have had a very amazing experience with Trusted Dental clinic.\\n\\nThe way she handled everything is speechless and the doctor is also very kind …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-131\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNKb3F2cFZnEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle2060.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUt3S0Rsb2Q2VUF4V3NmcDBKSFhXZUFDOFEwcE1GQ0Jjb0J3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNKb3F2cFZnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shilki Sheoran\"}, {\"$id\": \"42\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-29T10:14:44.6137578Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I came here because of toothache. After diagnosis by Dr. Taruna, my wisdom tooth had major cavity that went down to the roots. Finally, I went for the RCT. During this process doctor was polite, patient, calm and informative. Dr. Taruna is highly recommended from my perspective.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNMaGVDNGFREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Vicky Negi\"}, {\"$id\": \"43\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-29T10:14:44.6619136Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Dr. Taruna is an excellent dentist. She took the time to explain every procedure she was doing and she is a professional and has a naturally lovely personality. I would recommend Dr. Taruna to everyone. She is the best dentist I have ever had.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNWdXVTQjV3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pawan S\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"Shop UG-7, Alphathum by Bhutani, Sector 90, Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201304\", \"Website\": \"thetrusteddental.com\", \"Latitude\": 28.5127491, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.g