"Rohaan kumar\"}, {\"$id\": \"37\", \"Date\": \"2025-11-29T10:16:49.7260156Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Went to Dr. Unnavi Chauhan at Da Vinci Clinic for frequent dental cleaning and scaling. She is a calm and careful dentist. She explained my problem in simple words and did the treatment without rushing. The clinic was clean and the staff helped me well. Felt comfortable during the whole visit. Will go again ? …</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwRVJVbHBVRFExVFdaTU9HUnZOMTlWT1c5RmJGRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"raahul sharma\"}, {\"$id\": \"38\", \"Date\": \"2025-11-29T10:16:49.7759513Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I had a genuinely great experience at this dental clinic. The staff is polite, the clinic is clean, and the overall atmosphere feels hygienic and comfortable. The doctor explained every step clearly before starting the treatment, which helped reduce any anxiet</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pNNVZHTnRiSEE0T0RORFMxZFFhazFNVmtRMlNuYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Ashima Virmani\"}, {\"$id\": \"39\", \"Date\": \"2026-01-29T10:16:49.8309487Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I’m very satisfied with my visit. The dentist (Dr Unnavi) was extremely patient, professional, and made me feel comfortable throughout the treatment. Everything was explained clearly, and hygiene standards were excellent.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GUVIwbEhkRU5wYUhKNmNISmpUa2RuYWxsRk5tYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"dawar kirmani\"}, {\"$id\": \"40\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T10:16:49.8842805Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Amazing experience! Doctor is so polite and good at her job. Really recommend to anyone who is looking for dental consultation.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poUmVEaGFjRlp2ZW14NVJpMVJUM2RSYVZGRU5sRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Vijeet kaur\"}, {\"$id\": \"41\", \"Dat