dealt any pain. Overall experience was very good. Treatment was very friendly to pocket!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25oNE9XVjRZekZPWDFCWVRuUlBPRTFmYkVwcVoyYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pulkit Agarwal\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-01-29T10:34:25.8039022Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">You and your staff are wonderful, and our patients love your clinic and you! I\'m so glad to have you! Thank you so much for the prompt and efficient care I received at your clinic. Best Doctor Asif Malik</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxR01tdFZjamR6TVdwcWRWUkhRekpWYWxweVpHYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sachin Kumar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-01-29T10:34:25.8543973Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">My two RCT and and 3 Bridging was done ✅ One teath was doing much problems but treated well by Dr, So Good experience, Good Treatment</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21SYVltbGxSVUpNZEV4NlJta3pUbTFwU1RCNFIzYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"K Drawing club\"}, {\"Date\": \"2023-05-29T10:34:25.9112346Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Dr A malik is  the best doctor I would say for any dental problem the staff is welcoming and very polite.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURlMi0zV1p3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Hema Kumari\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-07-29T10:34:25.963689Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">“Excellent experience! The dentist explained everything clearly and made me feel comfortable. Highly recommended.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1MlNtaElhak5wVEhWUFZtTlBlVFZrVkdKYWEyYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Aadil Khan\"}, {\"Date\": \"2022-05-29T10:34:26.016613Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">We consulted this clinic for my mother. Root canal treatment was suggested by the doctor. Doctor is so convincing and he treated my mother very well. He has lot of patience and list