Time\": \"8 am–11 pm\"}, {\"Day\": \"Sunday\", \"Time\": \"8 am–11 pm\"}], \"Category\": \"More\"}]','{\"Reviews\": [{\"Date\": \"2025-10-29T10:56:46.1552799Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">If you like sweets here,you have serious taste/quality issue.\\nThis is 2nd time\\nBrought rasmalai from 2 shops …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-14\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsMGEwNW5UamROYVRWUlUwRjFXbWRDZW1WRFpIYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle175.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ak8zZWFXcTk2VUF4VXVycXdDSGJzekRxY1EwcE1GQ0FJb0FBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsMGEwNW5UamROYVRWUlUwRjFXbWRDZW1WRFpIYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Praveen Singh Chauhan\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-29T10:56:46.2062221Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I\'ve enjoyed their sweets and other food items before—it\'s a great brand known for consistently tasty offerings. At this particular branch, I tried the dhokla and it was delicious—soft, fresh, and full of flavor. I was also happy to see …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-15\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURJdVlpbUV3EAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle176.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ak8zZWFXcTk2VUF4VXVycXdDSGJzekRxY1EwcE1GQ0Fzb0FRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURJdVlpbUV3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shruti Sharma\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-08-29T10:56:46.2710173Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I orderd dosa and samosa, samosa was good but dosa was average and it did not justify the pricing.\\nOverall My experience was not so good, found it overpriced for some items considering quality of food,they provided.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 2, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toMFpXVmlSbU13YUhsMllqRmpSVVptVTNVdE5GRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pragyanand Kumar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-03-29T10:56:48.3416361Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Terrible Experience at Mithas Sweets, Crossing Republik – Avoid This Place!I ordered 5 pieces of samosas, but they were of completely poor quality – cold, stale, and not worth the full ₹100 I paid. When I told the counter executive they …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-17\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Sa2NGOUhXR3BxVERKWlFubG9XSE5PWHpST1JrRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle178.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ak8zZWFXcTk2VUF4VXVycXdDSGJzekRxY1EwcE1GQ0Iwb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Sa2NGOUhXR3BxVERKWlFubG9XSE5PWHpST1JrRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Vidur Tyagi\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-10-29T10:56:48.4072989Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Bought gulabjamun and kesari petha. As usual price are very high. The items were packed with polythene. Back home i found that instead of kesari petha they have given mango petha .</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 3, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GZlVsOWxUbFZLZEc5Q2IyeEpMWGxCVGxabFEzYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"kulbhushan aggarwal\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-29T10:56:50.4900373Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Worst ever tikki we had … bilkul kachi , n ur numbers are not working too. We just waste our money</span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VLbU43N1dTbW9yUnJRRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Jyotika Parmar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-02-28T10:56:50.5426751Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It\'s a really a nice sweet store but sometimes the staff cheats on us as one time I go there for having some Jalebi but the staff member at the stall give me the already cooked Jalebi. When I reached home and take a bite of it then it tastes very bad like using bad oils, etc</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 3, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210elUxbHhhVVZTUnkxU1JtMUtjVEpWVFdjd1pXYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Abhay Varshney\"}, {\"Date\": \"2021-05-29T10:56:50.6033971Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Place was clean and tidy. Safety precautions against the pandemic was appropriate. Food quality was fine. Prices are on slightly higher side but justiciable as they are maintaining the hygiene and such ambience. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-21\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURDdDREZXpnRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle182.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ak8zZWFXcTk2VUF4VXVycXdDSGJzekRxY1EwcE1GQ0RVb0J3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURDdDREZXpnRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Kanchan Saxena\"}, {\"Date\": \"2023-05-29T10:56:50.6558162Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Since this place is hardly 200m from my home, I hardly felt like going there for food but believe me they serve the most amazing food specially daal, tandoori roti, mix veg, paneer butter masala. Other dishes taste amazing as well. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-22\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURCeGJET1RREAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle183.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ak8zZWFXcTk2VUF4VXVycXdDSGJzekRxY1EwcE1GQ0VRb0NBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURCeGJET1RREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"preeti jain\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-29T10:56:50.7012878Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Bhature were soft well cooked, chhole were also tasty and  medium spicy.\\nDhokla’s also delicious.\\nJalebis Ok. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-23\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN6aUtpZW5nRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle184.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ak8zZWFXcTk2VUF4VXVycXdDSGJzekRxY1EwcE1GQ0ZNb0NRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 3, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN6aUtpZW5nRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Bhuvanesh Uniyal\"}], \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}','[{\"LargeUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAGWE22NAoiaAn7b_Fc_m9Z63sJbzPuzEgftcGpRK6AaEvh3u8GUANEc_B9hoi867lE_eV3slppUthI3ioWaDFrbDLpT8jOBb3ler2FM9aOWpCLz1jgpzR7cTR4osDp4QyaTVfGgnQ=s451-k-no\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAGWE22NAoiaAn7b_Fc_m9Z63sJbzPuzEgftcGpRK6AaEvh3u8GUANEc_B9hoi867lE_eV3slppUthI3ioWaDFrbDLpT8jOBb3ler2FM9aOWpCLz1jgpzR7cTR4osDp4QyaTVfGgnQ=w203-h152-k-no\"}, {\"LargeUrl\": \"\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAEb2mPkUZhyUcv3mqn6w_QuTJYw3dKZJIDDEDzXbu1mQxzNPnVRo_dGdp4ZjPfC5IeSDQKQxPvR2FNSSsdRukRJtcAtHyT7yok50Dl6iH4rH0fY30n8UNj7AGhkKdFQLXdVZpyOEg=w203-h114-k-no\"}, {\"LargeUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAHtIgKKCb5ymuKUf8u-w_4Cu4vTSwhkC_eeyEqYmTzfFEjUvySttm1rrTWzoFaCjLj-2bSKeaqMUUaXkOsvcAfRPfv_f1XX0Nsw8cMspAo_r4ErHZhCnIXYi4EK8u4FJhW8m_yUyA=s387-k-no\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAHtIgKKCb5ymuKUf8u-w_4Cu4vTSwhkC_eeyEqYmTzfFEjUvySttm1rrTWzoFaCjLj-2bSKeaqMUUaXkOsvcAfRPfv_f1XX0Nsw8cMspAo_r4ErHZhCnIXYi4EK8u4FJhW8m_yUyA=w203-h152-k-no\"}, {\"LargeUrl\": \"\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAEg9me1mCm6QJdtFgiqVWJ8ootl-_yf9ndQ8EK03xUzakdCkIeC90WUCD1ezbDzy9rGgjkgf4pq6gNHS_GlcvNINXsOINhe7ghvrYq2mlWwmXpkGIMiNtdAHPDibe-_jre1_xnv=w203-h152-k-no\"}, {\