 poor quality – cold, stale, and not worth the full ₹100 I paid. When I told the counter executive they …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-17\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Sa2NGOUhXR3BxVERKWlFubG9XSE5PWHpST1JrRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle178.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ak8zZWFXcTk2VUF4VXVycXdDSGJzekRxY1EwcE1GQ0Iwb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Sa2NGOUhXR3BxVERKWlFubG9XSE5PWHpST1JrRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Vidur Tyagi\"}, {\"$id\": \"42\", \"Date\": \"2025-10-29T10:56:48.4072989Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Bought gulabjamun and kesari petha. As usual price are very high. The items were packed with polythene. Back home i found that instead of kesari petha they have given mango petha .</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 3, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GZlVsOWxUbFZLZEc5Q2IyeEpMWGxCVGxabFEzYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"kulbhushan aggarwal\"}, {\"$id\": \"43\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-29T10:56:50.4900373Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Worst ever tikki we had … bilkul kachi , n ur numbers are not working too. We just waste our money</span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VLbU43N1dTbW9yUnJRRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Jyotika Parmar\"}, {\"$id\": \"44\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-28T10:56:50.5426751Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It\'s a really a nice sweet store but sometimes the staff cheats on us as one time I go there for having some Jalebi but the staff member at the stall give me the already cooked Jalebi. When I reached home and take a bite of it then it tastes very bad like using bad oils, etc</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 3, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210elUxbHhhVVZTUnkxU1JtMUtjVEpWVFdjd1pXYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Abhay Varshney\"}, {\"$id\": \"45\", \"Date\": \