g lot\", \"Plenty of parking\"]}]','[]','{\"Reviews\": [{\"Date\": \"2026-03-29T11:14:30.5994093Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Such a beautiful place and vibe. Must visit.\\nI had kunafa cheesecake, biscoff cheesecake, shahi kunafa bingsu and real fruit ice cream. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-14\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s4MFVrMUxORTFTY0ROMk1GRlNWbVJUV1VGeFFrRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle165.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ajg4S2lUcjk2VUF4VjF1cXdDSFlJeEJLb1EwcE1GQ0FJb0FBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s4MFVrMUxORTFTY0ROMk1GRlNWbVJUV1VGeFFrRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Ashu Rajput\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-09-29T11:14:30.6495972Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">This cute dessert place has my heart. They have Waffles, ice creams, bingsu, real fruit ice cream and much more. They have so many great flavours. My favourite was the Kunafa Bingsu. It was a great blend of unique flavours. I totally recommend this place! Also, they are open overnight, perfect for those late night snacks cravings.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ZMFFrUndTWFpaTWxvMGIxZEROMUJWZGxSdFpFRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Karon Anand\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-08-29T11:14:30.6985037Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Bliss and Bubbles – Dessert Heaven in Gaur City 2\\n\\nIf you’re a true dessert enthusiast, Bliss and Bubbles in Gaur City 2 is the …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-16\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5a1JrVk1ZekZZT0dSWk1XVm5TMGh3VkZaVldXYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle167.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ajg4S2lUcjk2VUF4VjF1cXdDSFlJeEJLb1EwcE1GQ0Rrb0FnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5a1JrVk1ZekZZT0dSWk1XVm5TMGh3VkZaVldXYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sameer Chaukhrat\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-03-29T11:14:30.7460108Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Its an amazing place to have fun with friends and enjoy amazing desserts. Their strawberry with chocolate is amazing and waffles is a must try. If you are looking for kunafa cheese cake, this is the place to find all combinations of kunafa with kunafa cheese pastry being the star</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-17\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWaFNtdHRVR2RRZFVoTFNXRnRSRFpWVVdKa2IyYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle168.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ajg4S2lUcjk2VUF4VjF1cXdDSFlJeEJLb1EwcE1GQ0hvb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWaFNtdHRVR2RRZFVoTFNXRnRSRFpWVVdKa2IyYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Karanjiv singh Bhutani\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-08-29T11:14:30.7969396Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I had the blueberry bingsu — it was so nice and delicious! I would definitely recommend this place for an ice cream treat. Plus, the owner is very friendly. ?? …</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkSlozVjNZMDUzZUhwWk9IbFFUbU5sYVhKZmJWRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Akansha Singh\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-12-29T11:14:30.84342Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Bliss and Bubbles is an absolute delight for cake lovers! The cakes are fresh, beautifully designed, and taste just as amazing as they look. Perfect balance of sweetness, soft texture, and rich flavors. The attention to detail and quality …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-19\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci