s a burst of flavor. The ambiance of the bakery is cozy and inviting, …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-17\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNEajYtMkJnEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle180.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUN4clNIdHQ2VUF4VXJzcXdDSFhBaUx5WVEwcE1GQ0c0b0FnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNEajYtMkJnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Gaurav Varshney\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-06-29T11:45:28.8268427Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I\'m beyond frustrated with Theobroma. Visited today in Greater Noida, desperate for a cool treat from the heat, and the AC was practically non-existent. It was uncomfortably warm, making the entire experience miserable. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-18\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGT1FtRnFZWE5xT1U1YVdsQnlPRnBCVlRCZlpYYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle181.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUN4clNIdHQ2VUF4VXJzcXdDSFhBaUx5WVEwcE1GQ0lBQktBTSJd\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGT1FtRnFZWE5xT1U1YVdsQnlPRnBCVlRCZlpYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Anmol\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-05-29T11:45:28.8956605Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I recently visited Theobroma Bakery and Cafe and thoroughly enjoyed their selection of pastries. Each pastry was delicious, boasting perfect textures and rich flavors. While the sitting area is small, it\'s cozy and ideal for grabbing an …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-19\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNUNXZHYjV3RRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle182.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\