blishment. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-27\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25rdFJFWlNWMkZ5YzBOSWFGbFdhVE51TWtob2FXYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle204.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUs2T3k1dXQ2VUF4V2twYXdDSGZPR0drVVEwcE1GQ0lvQktBYyJd\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 3, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25rdFJFWlNWMkZ5YzBOSWFGbFdhVE51TWtob2FXYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"vartika mathur\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-10-29T12:05:04.485107Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Bill Chill Cackery at DLF Mall of India is a delightful spot for dessert lovers. The café has a cozy, modern vibe and offers a wide range of indulgent treats — from creamy cheesecakes to rich, fudgy brownies. Their signature cold cakes and …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-28\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poYVZVbHNjMFJWWW5oMWQyazBZbEJ0TFdaaVZsRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle205.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aUs2T3k1dXQ2VUF4V2twYXdDSGZPR0drVVEwcE1GQ0pBQktBZyJd\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poYVZVbHNjMFJWWW5oMWQyazBZbEJ0TFdaaVZsRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pranjali Mishra\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-29T12:05:04.5362643Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">We had the most delightful meal, simple yet so satisfying. The ham and cheese toasties were perfectly crisp on the outside with warm, melty goodness inside. The coleslaw was perfectly paired alongside a refreshing feta and watermelon salad, …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-29\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNvLXZMV2lnRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle206