ous handmade cookies. A perfect treat to cherish and savour.\"}, {\"Id\": 11, \"Name\": \"GH2 Tea Cake, Cookies And Muffin Hamper\", \"Price\": 1, \"Description\": \"A soft and delectable tea cake paired with an assortment of delicious cookies and mouth watering muffins.\"}, {\"Id\": 12, \"Name\": \"GH6 Sticky Date Cake Hamper\", \"Price\": 1, \"Description\": \"A gloriously soft and moist, sticky date cake with dry fruits topped with an orange glaze.\"}, {\"Id\": 13, \"Name\": \"GH5 Tea Cake And Cookies Hamper\", \"Price\": 1, \"Description\": \"A glorious, moist and tender tea cake along with an assortment of our delectable cookies.\"}, {\"Id\": 14, \"Name\": \"GH7 Xmas Cookies Hamper\", \"Price\": 2, \"Description\": \"The finest selection of traditional artisanal christmas cookies. A fabulous addition to your christmas celebrations.\"}, {\"Id\": 15, \"Name\": \"GH8 Christmas Loaf Cake & Cookies Hamper\", \"Price\": 2, \"Description\": \"A gloriously delicious traditional plum cake paired with our artisanal christmas cookies.\"}, {\"Id\": 16, \"Name\": \"Plum Cake Hamper [Small]\", \"Price\": 1, \"Description\": \"\"}, {\"Id\": 17, \"Name\": \"Plum Pudding Hamper [Small]\", \"Price\": 1, \"Description\": \"\"}, {\"Id\": 18, \"Name\": \"GH9 Double Festive Loaf Cake & Cookies Hamper\", \"Price\": 2, \"Description\": \"A delightful festive plum cake along with a moist and tender sticky toffee cake, paired with our handcrafted christmas cookies.\"}, {\"Id\": 19, \"Name\": \"GH10 Christmas Pudding & Cookies Hamper\", \"Price\": 3, \"Description\": \"A moist, indulgent and luscious christmas pudding paired with our artisanal christmas cookies.\"}, {\"Id\": 20, \"Name\": \"GH11 Christmas Cake & Cookies Hamper\", \"Price\": 3, \"Description\": \"Traditional victorian plum cake filled with glorious brandy soaked dry fruits paired with our artisanal christmas cookies.\"}, {\"Id\": 21, \"Name\": \"GH3 Double Cake And Cookies Hamper\", \"Price\": 1, \"Description\": \"Double the cake, double the joy. Two luscious tea cake along with a delightful selection of handcrafted cookies.\"}, {\"Id\": 22, \"Name\": \"GH4 Brownie, Tea Cake And Cookies Hamper\", \"Price\": 2, \"Description\": \"An assortment of four indulgent, gooey brownies along with a delicious tea cake and handcrafted cookies.\"}, {\"Id\": 23, \"Name\": \"Chocolate & Orange Christmas Cake\", \"Price\": 3, \"Description\": \"\"}, {\"Id\": 24, \"Name\": \"GH21 The Christmas Tin\", \"Price\": 2, \"Description\": \"\"}, {\"Id\": 25, \"Name\": \"Chocolate & Orange Xmas Cake [6 Inches]\", \"Price\": 2, \"Description\": \"\"}], \"Price\": null, \"Category\": \"Hampers\", \"Description\": \"\"}, {\"Id\": 2, \"Name\": \"\", \"Items\": [{\"Id\": 1, \"Name\": \"Frosted Brownie\", \"Price\": 196.0, \"Description\": \"Dark and delicious fat fudgy brownie with a fabulous chocolate frosting.\"}, {\"Id\": 2, \"Name\": \"Nutella Cream Cheese Brownie\", \"Price\": 280.0, \"Description\": \"Gorgeous and indulgent chocolate brownies with swirls of nutella and cream cheese.\"}, {\"Id\": 3, \"Name\": \"Caramel Shortbread Brownie\", \"Price\": 252.0, \"Description\": \"Indulge in layers of gooey caramel, buttery shortbread, and fudgy brownie, creating a decadent treat with irresistible textures.\"}, {\"Id\": 4, \"Name\": \"Blondie Brownie\", \"Price\": 218.0, \"Description\": \"A golden hued delight, rich and buttery with a hint of vanilla, offering a delectable twist on the classic chocolate brownie.\"}, {\"Id\": 5, \"Name\": \"Fudge Brownie\", \"Price\": 180.0, \"Description\": \"Dive into the dense and velvety world of fudge brownies, each bite delivering a perfect balance of sweetness and rich cocoa goodness.\"}, {\"Id\": 6, \"Name\": \"Chocolate Brownie\", \"Price\": 219.0, \"Description\": \"A classic delight, this chocolate brownie boasts a dense, chewy texture and an intense cocoa flavor for an indulgent chocolate experience.\"}, {\"Id\": 7, \"Name\": \"Walnut Brownie\", \"Price\": 255.0, \"