 people.. snacks of all types like Indian fast food are here. You will see many kitty parties there.. so overall nice experience. And also dedicated space allocated for Birthday, Anniversary parties..</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-27\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aVVVrbE5ja3hpVnpGQ1JrVm5SV2RFUlU1a2FVRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle236.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aVZzTmI1d042VUF4VkpycXdDSGJXUkQ5c1EwcE1GQ0RZb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aVVVrbE5ja3hpVnpGQ1JrVm5SV2RFUlU1a2FVRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Pravesh Sah\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-05-29T12:34:10.7253434Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Best service and decorum found nearby my residence. Food quality is top notch. Service is good. A bit slow but that is fine because the food they serve is worth waiting for. Staffs are very humble. Seating and arrangements are very nice and …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-28\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM3cExuOFBREAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle237.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aVZzTmI1d042VUF4VkpycXdDSGJXUkQ5c1EwcE1GQ0Q0b0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM3cExuOFBREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shilpi Biswas\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-29T12:34:10.7737889Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">We celebrated my wifey’s baby shower, and it turned out amazing. The staff were so supportive and provided great service. I absolutely loved the cake—they decorated it beautifully.</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-29\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUN