, \"Reviewer\": \"Dhruba jyoti Das\"}, {\"$id\": \"58\", \"Date\": \"2026-05-29T12:34:13.0020842Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">We’ve had dinner with kids. Plenty of varieties. Dinner was okay. They have option for vrat too. Ambience is good, clean place. Service is good. Kids friendly env, I liked breakfast (poori sbzi with Lassi) here as compared to dinner. Overall nice place.</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-32\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURudWF6MFp3EAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle241.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aVZzTmI1d042VUF4VkpycXdDSGJXUkQ5c1EwcE1GQ0hvb0NBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURudWF6MFp3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Yash Srivastava\"}, {\"$id\": \"59\", \"Date\": \"2025-11-29T12:34:13.0460023Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">When Madan Sweets and Restaurant first opened in Greater Noida West, it was an excellent place for family gatherings, birthday celebrations, and casual dining. The service was attentive, and the overall experience was impressive. However, …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-33\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xJMVJFaDBibmRsV21oMk1GRjJibGg0TkU5SVowRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle242.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aVZzTmI1d042VUF4VkpycXdDSGJXUkQ5c1EwcE1GQ0pBQktBayJd\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 2, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xJMVJFaDBibmRsV21oMk1GRjJibGg0TkU5SVowRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Vipin Sachan\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"GF- 21 Central Plaza market Shahberi, road, Bhangel, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201318\", \"Website\": \"\