n><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-74\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21RNVMwRndZVmRQTkVOelIzVlZUVzg0VjE4MGEyYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle647.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3al9vWlcyd2Q2VUF4VjB1NndDSFliQ0o5QVEwcE1GQ0FJb0FBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21RNVMwRndZVmRQTkVOelIzVlZUVzg0VjE4MGEyYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"tuhin s\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-03-29T12:36:15.5475147Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I ordered for aaloo papad from Myra sweets. The aaloo papads were absolutely delicious! They were perfectly crispy after frying and had a wonderful light texture. The flavor was well-balanced — not too spicy, yet full of taste. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-75\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCVFdscDBlSFEyZEVSTGRteGZhMHBSYjNRMFdFRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle648.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3al9vWlcyd2Q2VUF4VjB1NndDSFliQ0o5QVEwcE1GQ0FVb0FRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCVFdscDBlSFEyZEVSTGRteGZhMHBSYjNRMFdFRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Ritu Prasad\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-03-29T12:36:15.6003904Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I have ordered multiple items from Mayra Sweets\\n, and every time the taste has been truly authentic and delicious. The food feels just like home-cooked meals — fresh, flavorful, and comforting. Highly recommended for anyone looking for genuine homemade taste. Definitely worth trying!”</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pFMVJFeHBWV3RrTWxCUVJYQTFjVVIzVDNKMVFXYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shikha Jain\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-10-29T12:36:15.646907Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Thanks Mayra Sweets,\\nI wanted to take a moment to thank you Raj ji for the wonderful service and delicious food at my son’s birthday party yesterday. Everything — from the …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-77\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOVGNXaERTRTVvWkVGbVIzZDJNVEZPZFZOVWJYYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle650.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3al9vWlcyd2Q2VUF4VjB1NndDSFliQ0o5QVEwcE1GQ0Fzb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOVGNXaERTRTVvWkVGbVIzZDJNVEZPZFZOVWJYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Reena Anwani\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-12-29T12:36:15.6946201Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Myra sweets is an authentic , tasty and hygenic sweet shop. What ever i have ordered is upto mark.\\nMr Raj is keeping his words of supplying us these delicious preperations.\\nI highly recommend Myra sweets.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pSQlNXaHFZWGt3Vm1RM1NscFhWek5aZVRJNVJIYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Punita Kochhar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-10-29T12:36:15.7432819Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I ordered sweets from Myra sweets this Diwali!\\nAnd want to Thank Rajkumar bhaiya for tasty and moreover fresh and pure sweets at the time of so much rush. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-79\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CRk5FaEpWWFF5Tm5WVVNFWjNaelYwU0c5UE1rRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle652.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3al9vWlcyd2Q2VUF4VjB1NndDSFliQ0o5QVEwcE1GQ0JFb0JRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CRk5FaEpWWFF5Tm5WVVNFWjNaelYwU0c5UE1rRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"rashmi mishra\"}