\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wZk0wSkVORk5aY2swd1JIRTBlV1JFVUVkM1ZuYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Dharmendra Tiwari\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-06-08T03:33:54.4545501Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I had a great experience at Red diagnostics. Everything is so systematic and radiologists are so experienced and helpful.\\nI have gone through my corporate plan of Gold Health complete check up. I really loved their services, hygiene and on time delivery of reports.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VKdWhxcjN3ejduMkt3EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Yash Singh\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-08T03:33:54.5392523Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Staff is really good ....staff is really cooperative...all the facilities are really nice...over all nice experience..must visit</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wdVVYTkxPRFpQYlVOdlVGaExZMWhXWlRCblZuYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"keerti Choudhary\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-07-08T03:33:54.5877981Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The experience was amazing. The staff is well trained to keep patients calm and comfortable. They are very polite, friendly and super efficient. Special thanks to Farhat mam and Jyoti mam for making me comfortable.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pNNVlVTk9ZVzF5T0dWNFJEZFFka1pZWlVWV1ZWRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Kirtika K\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-11-08T03:33:54.6324011Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Professional ambience, polite and active staff members. Hygiene practices followed aptly! Recommended!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxcmQzVXRSM0ZmVTFkbE1GcHVkVjlIWDI4dGNIYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Aamna Ahmaed\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-12-08T03:33:54.6787087Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Great team, supported me each test and did all tests very quickly</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHlj