 efficient. Special thanks to Farhat mam and Jyoti mam for making me comfortable.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pNNVlVTk9ZVzF5T0dWNFJEZFFka1pZWlVWV1ZWRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Kirtika K\"}, {\"$id\": \"36\", \"Date\": \"2025-11-08T03:33:54.6324011Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Professional ambience, polite and active staff members. Hygiene practices followed aptly! Recommended!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxcmQzVXRSM0ZmVTFkbE1GcHVkVjlIWDI4dGNIYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Aamna Ahmaed\"}, {\"$id\": \"37\", \"Date\": \"2025-12-08T03:33:54.6787087Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Great team, supported me each test and did all tests very quickly</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKVE5WUmZSRlJ5TkV4blZ6RkxPV3RaWWprMVVIYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shubham Vishwakarma\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"RG D-82A, D-Block, Sector 26, Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201301\", \"Website\": \"\", \"Latitude\": 28.57799, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/RED+DIAGNOSTICS/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390ce5d1c13f36db:0x98dd3e2832f6d794!8m2!3d28.57799!4d77.33737!16s%2Fg%2F11lysrbks2!19sChIJ2zY_wdHlDDkRlNf2Mig-3Zg?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1\", \"AvgRating\": 4.9, \"Longitude\": 77.33737, \"NameHindi\": \"रेड डायग्नोस्टिक्स\", \"Description\": \"\", \"WebsiteLink\": \"\", \"TotalReviews\": 140, \"BusinessHours\": {\"$id\": \"16\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"17\", \"Hours\": {\"$id\": \"18\", \"$values\": [{\"$id\": \"19\", \"Day\": \"Monday\", \"Time\": \"8 am–8:30 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"20\", \"Day\": \"Tuesday\", \"Time\": \"8 am–8:30 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"21\", \"Day\": \"Wednesday\", \"Time\": \"8 am–8:30 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"22\", \"Day\": \"Thursday\", \"Time\": \"8 am–8:30 pm\"}, {\"$id\": \"23\", \"Day\": \"Friday\", \"Time\": \"8 am–8:30 pm\"}, {\"$id\"