is enjoying thoroughly and is learning a lot each and every day. I love the personal care and attention they provide to him. The staff is also very cooperative …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-44\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNEenNhTFdBEAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle440.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aWlyZTdmNWZhVUF4VzhzS3dDSGUxWkZ1NFEwcE1GQ0Fnb0FnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNEenNhTFdBEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"ishani kanungo\"}, {\"$id\": \"19\", \"Date\": \"2024-06-08T04:22:44.3417856Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Peas in Pod the best preschool for our child amazing qualified staff &amp; well mannered , very much concerned about the safety of the child ,beautiful interior of the school clean n hygienic  preschool for the child I wish them all the best for the future .\\nArti Bhatia</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNENGN5NGtBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Arti Bhatia\"}, {\"$id\": \"20\", \"Date\": \"2024-06-08T04:22:46.162698Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The best preschool for our child amazing  preschooling for our little champs with supportive staff n give a special care to our kids I am very happy with the school &amp; staff very best of luck to the entire family of\\nPeas in Pod Raksha Addela</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNENGZ5ZU9BEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Uma Ganesh\"}, {\"$id\": \"21\", \"Date\": \"2024-06-08T04:22:51.0072325Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">This is great pre-school and a great place for childhood development. The atmosphere is very conducive to overall development of the child in the initial year. Great bunch of people as well.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNEdS1DdWVnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"satya sovan Patnaik\"}, {\"$id\": \"22\", \"Date\": \"2024-06-08T04:22:52.3251056Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The school not only imparts education but also places great emphasis on nurturing their personalities, firmly believing in the development of well-rounded individuals.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNENDVlbGZnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Virendra Singh Rathore\"}, {\"$id\": \"23\", \"Date\": \"2026-06-08T04:22:54.9532886Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Very disappointing experience with Peas in Pod Raksha Adela.\\nMy 3-year-old with ADHD symptoms was repeatedly isolated from class in the name of discipline, which only triggered him and worsened his condition. This caused …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-49\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WclNHaGllVnBLU25oMU1XcFdkMHhSTTJKSVpGRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle445.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aWlyZTdmNWZhVUF4VzhzS3dDSGUxWkZ1NFEwcE1GQ0Jjb0J3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WclNHaGllVnBLU25oMU1XcFdkMHhSTTJKSVpGRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Rabiya Khatoon\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"Flat No. G002, BLOCK-G, RAKSHA ADDELA, L block, Gaur City 1, Gaur City 2, Greater Noida, Ghaziabad, Uttar Pradesh 201009\", \"Website\": \"pipschools.com\", \"Latitude\": 28.6120822, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Peas+in+Pod+Preschool+%26+Daycare,+Raksha+Addela,+Gaur+City+2/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390cef52fec7ce29:0x2bc42dc7148b0ebc!8m2!3d28.6120822!4d77.423203!16s%2Fg%2F11vs__7hkh!19sChIJKc7H_lLvDDkRvA6LFMctxCs?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1\", \"AvgRating\": 4.5, \"Longitude\": 77.423203, \"NameHindi\": \"पीस इन पॉड प्रिस्कूल & ड