E\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle208.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ajQyWWV1NmZhVUF4VV9zcXdDSGRoUU96d1EwcE1GQ0FJb0FBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUd0lDakdBEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Anuj Kumar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-06-08T04:38:51.0588845Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">gr.noida is the worst college, even if someone comes from 200 km away to deliver the paper, money is charged from him for keeping the luggage, which is the first time in my life that I have seen that they are paying the college expenses by taking money from the luggage.  You can understand how bad college it will be.?? …</span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNKNkpXbVNnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Neer Tomer\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-06-08T04:38:51.1150636Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Janhit Institute of Education in Bapudham, Ghaziabad, offers excellent programs like MBA, B.Ed, LLB, BTC, and BA LLB combined at very reasonable prices. The institute provides quality education with a strong focus on professional growth. A great choice for students looking for affordable yet effective learning!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURnX0lmNWFBEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Kashi Nath verma\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-06-08T04:38:53.2425811Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Janhit College is the worst college in Greater Noida, At the time of admission they told us that if your child takes admission somewhere else before the classes start then your money will be refunded But when we took admission somewhere …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-17\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM3cGNLT29nRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle211.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ajQyWWV1NmZhVUF4VV9zcXdDSGRoUU96d1EwcE1GQ0Nzb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM3cGNLT29nRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Nisha Chauhan\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-06-08T04:38:55.3362032Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">They are so pathetic that on the day of entrance they usually visit the centre and ask students for their numbers. If by mistake you share the number, they will make you calls uncountable times with different contact number despite of …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-18\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3cmFXLWx3RRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle212.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ajQyWWV1NmZhVUF4VV9zcXdDSGRoUU96d1EwcE1GQ0M0b0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3cmFXLWx3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shivani Rai\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-02-08T04:38:57.4435499Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">This is a very dirty institute, there is no cleanliness, the washroom is very dirty...and there is no mirror either!!!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOSFZIbFpVWEJ4Ym1kcE1HOHpWRko2YlhsV1pWRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Akhil Yadav\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-06-08T04:38:59.5568317Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">\\\"Unfortunately, my experience at college did not meet my expectations. While I was excited to start, I found that several aspects of the college were disappointing. Despite reaching out for support, communication with certain departments …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-20\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURYa1pqRHdnRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle214.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ajQyWWV1NmZhVUF4VV9zcXdDSGRoUU96d1EwcE1GQ0RRb0JnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURYa1pqRHdnRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Akshit Tyagi\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-06-08T04:38:59.6050095Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I am Anjali.  Student of B.ED I am studying here last 1 year and I feel so comfortable here . It\'s an amazing college. Here is lots of facility.  Teachers are very supportive. And it\'s environment is also very positive.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUZ0xtV09BEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Anjali Sharma\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-06-08T04:38:59.6712514Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Attending janhit institute of education and information has been an enriching experience. The college boasts a vibrant campus life, fostering a sense of community among students. The faculty is highly knowledgeable and approachable, always willing to provide guidance and support.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUbklDdXdRRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"vishesh tyagi\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-06-08T04:38:59.727107Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I\'m doing my d.el.ed diploma from janhit . I must say this is something students want who are preparing for other competitive exams as they help in everything,give you time and other facilities like lab library you can use . Fees are so reasonable n affordable with this also provide quality education in both Hindi n English medium.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUd0pxQk93EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"recruiting xpert\"}], \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}','[{\"LargeUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAE6TGtty6J9vQuR7YtPmhPtfP8Qkzyz6eTt5LiZlDjSeKMDrhGfOaeISO74qoGKWGjXOa1UtIVFnnJyuqaBRYqtQq2hKthzZoUyzgl6Q439gDWgWQvdWRVUukCCh3d-LzWn3_zBZA=s516-k-no\", \"ThumbUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/APNQkAE6TGtty6J9vQuR7YtPmhPtfP8Qkzyz6eTt5L