ask students for their numbers. If by mistake you share the number, they will make you calls uncountable times with different contact number despite of …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-18\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3cmFXLWx3RRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle212.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ajQyWWV1NmZhVUF4VV9zcXdDSGRoUU96d1EwcE1GQ0M0b0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3cmFXLWx3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shivani Rai\"}, {\"$id\": \"33\", \"Date\": \"2026-02-08T04:38:57.4435499Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">This is a very dirty institute, there is no cleanliness, the washroom is very dirty...and there is no mirror either!!!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOSFZIbFpVWEJ4Ym1kcE1HOHpWRko2YlhsV1pWRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Akhil Yadav\"}, {\"$id\": \"34\", \"Date\": \"2026-06-08T04:38:59.5568317Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">\\\"Unfortunately, my experience at college did not meet my expectations. While I was excited to start, I found that several aspects of the college were disappointing. Despite reaching out for support, communication with certain departments …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-20\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURYa1pqRHdnRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle214.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ajQyWWV1NmZhVUF4VV9zcXdDSGRoUU96d1EwcE1GQ0RRb0JnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": null, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURYa1pqRHdnRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Akshit Tyagi\"}, {\"$id\": \"35\", \"Date\": \"2024-06-08T04:38:59.6050095Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I am Anjali.  Student of B.ED I am studying here last 1 year and I feel so comfortable here . It\'s an amazing college. Here is lots of facility.  Teachers are very supportive. And it\'s environment is also very positive.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUZ0xtV09BEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Anjali Sharma\"}, {\"$id\": \"36\", \"Date\": \"2024-06-08T04:38:59.6712514Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Attending janhit institute of education and information has been an enriching experience. The college boasts a vibrant campus life, fostering a sense of community among students. The faculty is highly knowledgeable and approachable, always willing to provide guidance and support.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUbklDdXdRRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"vishesh tyagi\"}, {\"$id\": \"37\", \"Date\": \"2024-06-08T04:38:59.727107Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">I\'m doing my d.el.ed diploma from janhit . I must say this is something students want who are preparing for other competitive exams as they help in everything,give you time and other facilities like lab library you can use . Fees are so reasonable n affordable with this also provide quality education in both Hindi n English medium.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUd0pxQk93EAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"recruiting xpert\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"Plot No. 38-B, Knowledge Park I, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201310\", \"Website\": \"jiei.in\", \"Latitude\": 28.467644, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Janhit+Institute+of+Education+and+Information/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390cc1d66ab19131:0xd34f5013a4676da8!8m2!3d28.467644!4d77.506434!16s%2Fg%2F1tmqk4t2!19sChIJMZGxatbBDDkRqG1npBNQT9M?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1\", \"AvgRating\": 3.5, \"Longitude\": 77.506434, \"NameHindi\": \"जनहित इंस्टिट्यूट ऑफ एजुकेशन एण्ड इन्फॉर्मेशन\", \"D