=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">BLS is a great and wonderful school. It is giving very apt platform for the kids to develop their skill set. This school will surely set new benchmark in Noida and Greater Noida West under an excellent leadership of its Principal Sushma Punia Mam.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3aEppNjVBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"bhavya srivastava\"}, {\"$id\": \"37\", \"Date\": \"2026-06-08T04:45:40.6389479Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Teachers are really supportive n school is working really hard n improving day by day.\\nI feel school has lots more potential. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-104\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRcVk2azFnRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1714.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aVQwT2J4NnZhVUF4VXBzS3dDSFFfc0wtOFEwcE1GQ0JFb0JRIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 3, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRcVk2azFnRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Nisha Malhotra\"}, {\"$id\": \"38\", \"Date\": \"2026-06-08T04:45:40.7271545Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Pros:\\n1. It\'s pretty good wrt infrastructure.\\n2. Everyone from transport, administration , teachers all are open for …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-105\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNJbWRycjNBRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1715.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aVQwT2J4NnZhVUF4VXBzS3dDSFFfc0wtOFEwcE1GQ0JRb0JnIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNJbWRycjNBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"spoorti jain\"}, {\"$id\": \"39\", \"Date\": \"2026-06-08T04:45:40.7753772Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">We got our child admitted last year. We got exceptional support from Principal and vice principal madam. The foundation head Anju madam individually knows how each child is performing and what do the need to flourish. …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-106\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3dnUycU5REAE\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1716.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3aVQwT2J4NnZhVUF4VXBzS3dDSFFfc0wtOFEwcE1GQ0Jjb0J3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3dnUycU5REAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"DHAVAL DHOLAKIA\"}, {\"$id\": \"40\", \"Date\": \"2026-06-08T04:45:40.8238718Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Hello, I got admission for my ward anshuman Class UKG-A, class teacher Shivani Ma\'am, she is first teacher of my child. I must say that she is very caring, loving  and supportive teacher, and also principal ma\'am, sports director VK singh sir, chess coach Narayan sir Thanks to all</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChRDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3dUpKchAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Bandana Kishore\"}, {\"$id\": \"41\", \"Date\": \"2026-06-08T04:45:40.8716189Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">A very good school indeed. Led by a dynamic Principal, the team of teachers and staff is of high quality and the classrooms are clean, having a lot of facilities for the students to not only study but also have all round development.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURfNzQ3WHFBRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Taral Vaidya\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"HS 03, Sector 16 Panchsheel Greens 2, West, Greater Noida, Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201318\", \"Website\": \"blsworldschool.com\", \"Latitude\": 28.6143497, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/BLS+World+School+%7C+best+schools+in+greater+noida+