 the Amrapali projects...now completed in compliance of honable Supreme court direcions.... with all basic amenities.... parking, club, gym, swimming pool games area under development.....giving peace of mind to its owners.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGa2RIWkhNRmMwVEZvMFowSlBYMUpCTjBOdVpIYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Vinay Kumar\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-09-08T04:56:26.9731865Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Location wise it\'s a very good township.\\nSociety is big and well maintained. Minor issues are everywhere and NBCC should focus on working on it.\\nAll in all good place to live</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1b09IQnVWSEUzWjJsa2JUSlpURk16YlRSb1RYYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Abhishek Gupta\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-01-08T04:56:27.1345031Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">This society is elegant and maintenance is good no any problem in this society</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psTU5tWlViR05oUjFkME1HRm9jVnBYTmxWWFgzYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Ashish Saini\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-06-08T04:56:27.263744Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Located in a very convenient location...Good access to so many schools within close proximity...very near to main road...just half a kilometre to reach Mall.. Supermarkets and Restaurants.. Ideal place for families with kids.</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRMEtpcmRREAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Haneet Oberoi\"}, {\"Date\": \"2024-06-08T04:56:27.3767151Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Amrapali Centurian Park Low Rise Apartments in Greater Noida West offer residents a serene and peaceful living environment. The low-rise design provides a sense of community and privacy, with spacious apartments and well-maintained green …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-141\\\" aria-label=\\