y polite he did fantastic job everybody was …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-114\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGcFJHRkRVRzFIWlZBMlRqSlJTbVp2Ym5oa1EyYxAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1016.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ampxUGJNX3ZhVUF4V2RuYXdDSFlJQkRWd1EwcE1GQ0JFb0F3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 4, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGcFJHRkRVRzFIWlZBMlRqSlJTbVp2Ym5oa1EyYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Priyanka Kaushik\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-07-08T06:13:51.782972Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">We recently celebrated our son’s first birthday and I couldn’t have asked for a better team to bring it all together. From the stunning stage decor to the lively games that kept the kids smiling throughout, every detail was beautifully …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-115\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VMT0hxcEMyLU83NHl3RRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1017.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ampxUGJNX3ZhVUF4V2RuYXdDSFlJQkRWd1EwcE1GQ0Nnb0JBIl0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VMT0hxcEMyLU83NHl3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Shailesh Pradeep\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-10-08T06:13:51.8820636Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">The food was amazing, property was awesome we enjoyed a lot, staff was good. Overall we enjoyed the party to the fullest</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ONE9VZGlSbHB0VTJWSE1tVkdjakJSYzNsVlFuYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"rahul rawat\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-08-08T06:13:51.9374569Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Well executed and exceeded my expectations, job well done.\\nThe decoration was outstanding.\\nVery nicely done the event. Everything was so planned.\\nJust love their creativity, they really did a wonderful job!</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKWGIxSnZMVVZGTUhSTWJTMUhVMVp2U25ScmRHYxAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"megha dikshit\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-06-08T06:13:52.0044852Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">We recently used ‘Shrestha events’ planner for decoration for our parents\' marriage anniversary and our child\'s birthday,  and the outcome was fantastic. For the anniversary, the setup was sophisticated and heartwarming, perfectly capturing …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-118\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURIb1BpMHF3RRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1020.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:WyIwYWhVS0V3ampxUGJNX3ZhVUF4V2RuYXdDSFlJQkRWd1EwcE1GQ0VVb0J3Il0=\\\">More</button></span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURIb1BpMHF3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Preeti\"}, {\"Date\": \"2025-12-08T06:13:52.1088891Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Shreshta Event management team organized our 25th Anniversary celebration. All the arrangements and food was appreciated by all the guests. I had to spend no time to manage them and it was all done very professionally. Thank You</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kb00wWTJSRlYzUjNZd09FNXhPR280TldSM2IwRRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Sudhanshu Bhandari\"}, {\"Date\": \"2026-06-08T06:13:52.1623673Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Awesome work\\n\\nThe theme is so fun and well-executed—it really sets the perfect party mood …</span><span> <button class=\\\"w8nwRe kyuRq\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"ucc-120\\\" aria-label=\\\"See more\\\" data-review-id=\\\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNJaE96bmlBRRAB\\\" jsaction=\\\"pane.wfvdle1022.review.expandReview\\\" jslog=\\\"63707; track:click;metadata:Wy