u Kumar\"}, {\"$id\": \"36\", \"Date\": \"2026-06-08T06:14:55.7065812Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">Great work ??? I\'ll book you again …</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN2bDZpNGZnEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Akram Khan\"}, {\"$id\": \"37\", \"Date\": \"2026-06-08T06:14:55.8272248Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">It was amazing decoration</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN2bDZUT2x3RRAB\", \"Reviewer\": \"Nites Kumar\"}, {\"$id\": \"38\", \"Date\": \"2024-06-08T06:14:55.9397015Z\", \"Text\": \"<div><span class=\\\"wiI7pd\\\">???Bhaiya, your work is very good, love you Bhaiya ???? …</span></div>\", \"Rating\": 5, \"ReviewId\": \"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKX19xN1lBEAE\", \"Reviewer\": \"Kapil Verma\"}]}, \"TotalReviews\": 0, \"AverageRating\": 0}, \"Actions\": {\"$id\": \"2\", \"$values\": []}, \"Address\": \"near Khajoor chok, Yusufpur, chak shaberi, Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh 201009\", \"Website\": \"event07.com\", \"Latitude\": 28.6218287, \"MenuLink\": \"\", \"PlaceUrl\": \"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Event07+-+Balloon+Decoration+Services+%7C+Noida+%7C+Delhi+%7C+Ghaziabad/data=!4m7!3m6!1s0x390cef810387988b:0x2631edf167dd7d48!8m2!3d28.6218287!4d77.414013!16s%2Fg%2F11s8x3xv81!19sChIJi5iHA4HvDDkRSH3dZ_HtMSY?authuser=0&hl=en&rclk=1\", \"AvgRating\": 5.0, \"Longitude\": 77.414013, \"NameHindi\": \"इवेंट07 - बैलून डेकोरेशन सर्विसेज | नोएडा | दिल्ली | गाजियाबाद\", \"Description\": \"\", \"WebsiteLink\": \"http://event07.com/\", \"TotalReviews\": 11, \"BusinessHours\": {\"$id\": \"26\", \"$values\": []}}','2026-06-08 11:45:16',0,28.6218287,77.414013,1);
